# Rows: topic; original exercise; physical inference; competing faulty interpretation.
# Each cell is Traditional Chinese ~ English. All quantitative work is hypothetical.
LESSONS={}
def lessons(cid,body):
 rows=[]
 for line in body.strip().splitlines():
  cells=[v.strip().split('~',1) for v in line.split('|')]
  assert len(cells)==4 and all(len(c)==2 for c in cells),(cid,line)
  rows.append(cells)
 assert len(rows)==12,(cid,len(rows))
 LESSONS[cid]=rows
lessons('a067', '''
移除量與平坦度~Removal versus planarity | 畫三點研磨前後高度並分算移除量和剩餘高差~Draw before/after heights at three sites and calculate removal separately from residual height difference | 均勻移除不保證原有地形被平坦化~Uniform removal need not flatten existing topography | 把所有位置厚度同減視為已平坦~Treating equal thickness reduction everywhere as planarization
Preston 近似~Preston approximation | 自訂壓力與相對速度矩陣，以 R=kPV 比較相對速率並註明 k 固定假設~Choose hypothetical pressure and speed pairs; compare R=kPV with a stated constant-k assumption | 線性經驗式只在校正範圍內可用~A linear empirical law is valid only in its calibrated range | 把同一 k 套用所有膜材與漿料~Using one k for every film and slurry
晶圓徑向控制~Radial wafer control | 畫中心、中圈與邊緣厚度偏差，指定各區壓力修正方向~Plot center, middle and edge thickness errors and assign pressure-correction directions | 區域控制需要保留空間資料~Zonal control requires spatial data | 用全片平均遮住邊緣殘膜~Hiding edge residue behind the wafer mean
圖形密度~Pattern density | 並列密線與孤立線截面，標記相同研磨時間後的局部形貌~Compare dense and isolated lines and mark local topography after equal polishing time | 圖形密度改變局部接觸與材料移除~Pattern density changes local contact and removal | 把裸膜速率直接當成圖形晶圓速率~Equating blanket-film rate with patterned-wafer rate
碟陷與侵蝕~Dishing and erosion | 分別畫寬金屬線中央凹陷及密集區整體下沉，標示量測基準~Draw wide-line center recess and dense-area lowering with measurement datums | 碟陷與侵蝕是不同的幾何量~Dishing and erosion are different geometric quantities | 只給一個粗糙度數字判斷兩者~Using one roughness number to identify both
停止層選擇性~Stop-layer selectivity | 假設兩膜移除速率，算選擇比並追蹤過研磨後停止層厚度~Assume two removal rates, compute selectivity and track stop-layer loss during overpolish | 高選擇性不代表停止層完全不損失~High selectivity does not imply zero stop-layer loss | 把選擇性當成無限停止能力~Treating selectivity as an infinite stop
研磨墊狀態~Pad condition | 畫新墊、釉化墊與修整後接觸分布，規劃監測磨耗的試片~Sketch contact distributions for new, glazed and conditioned pads and specify a wear monitor | 墊表面演化會改變移除與均勻度~Pad evolution changes removal and uniformity | 只記累積片數而忽略墊狀態~Recording wafer count while ignoring pad state
終點訊號~Endpoint signal | 自製有基線漂移的反射訊號，標出候選終點及獨立厚度查核~Create a reflectance trace with baseline drift and mark endpoint candidates and independent thickness checks | 終點訊號需要材料與圖形背景解釋~Endpoint signals require material and pattern context | 把任何訊號突變都當成清除完成~Calling every signal jump complete clearing
漿料輸送~Slurry delivery | 畫入口、旋轉接觸區與排液，辨識停滯區和供液中斷~Map inlet, rotating contact and drainage; identify stagnant areas and delivery interruptions | 入口流量不等於每一位置都得到相同化學條件~Inlet flow does not guarantee identical local chemistry | 用總流量證明所有接觸區充分更新~Using total flow to prove renewal everywhere
研磨後潔淨~Post-CMP cleanliness | 將殘留磨粒、金屬污染與水痕分開，為各類選擇檢查證據~Separate residual abrasive, metal contamination and watermarks and assign evidence for each | 低刮傷數不能證明表面化學潔淨~Few scratches do not prove chemical cleanliness | 只用光學外觀核准表面~Accepting the surface from optical appearance alone
量測誤差帳本~Measurement-error ledger | 對同一片前後測點配對，估算厚度差的不確定度~Pair pre/post sites and estimate uncertainty of the thickness difference | 移除量差值包含兩次量測誤差~Removal differences contain errors from both measurements | 將不同位置量測相減當成真實移除~Subtracting unmatched locations as true removal
整合驗收~Integration acceptance | 將殘膜、碟陷、刮傷和下一層微影焦距需求放入同一驗收表~Combine residual film, dishing, scratches and next-layer focus needs in one acceptance table | CMP 驗收必須連到後續整合要求~CMP acceptance must connect to downstream integration | 只追求最快移除而取消後續平坦度要求~Optimizing removal speed while discarding downstream flatness
''')
lessons('a068', '''
磨粒族群~Abrasive populations | 比較相同平均粒徑但不同大粒尾端的兩個假設分布~Compare hypothetical distributions with equal means but different large-particle tails | 稀少大顆粒可能主導刮傷~Rare large particles can dominate scratching | 只用平均粒徑核准漿料~Qualifying slurry from mean particle size alone
數目與強度分布~Number versus intensity distributions | 為 DLS 與單粒計數各畫輸出座標，說明何者強調散射大顆粒~Sketch DLS and single-particle-count outputs and explain large-particle scattering weighting | 不同粒徑方法的分布權重不同~Particle-sizing methods use different distribution weightings | 直接疊合強度分布和數目分布比較濃度~Comparing concentration by overlaying intensity and number distributions
稀釋代表性~Dilution representativeness | 設計原液與兩個稀釋倍數的測試帳本並回算每毫升顆粒數~Plan stock and two dilution measurements and back-calculate counts per milliliter | 稀釋可能改變團聚平衡~Dilution can alter aggregation equilibrium | 假定稀釋只改濃度完全不改族群~Assuming dilution changes concentration but never populations
膠體穩定性~Colloidal stability | 畫表面電荷、離子屏蔽和碰撞，比較鹽度改變後的團聚趨勢~Sketch surface charge, ionic screening and collisions; compare aggregation after ionic-strength changes | 靜電排斥受溶液條件影響~Electrostatic repulsion depends on solution conditions | 認為同一磨粒在任何溶液都穩定~Assuming one abrasive is stable in every solution
化學與機械分工~Chemical and mechanical roles | 用兩色標示膜表面反應與磨粒移除，再列出速率和缺陷兩個響應~Color-code surface reaction and abrasive removal and list rate and defect responses | 化學反應與接觸摩擦共同決定 CMP~Surface chemistry and mechanical contact jointly determine CMP | 只增加磨粒硬度就推定整體性能提高~Assuming harder abrasive always improves overall performance
選擇性矩陣~Selectivity matrix | 對目標膜與阻擋膜填寫假設速率矩陣，區分速率增益和選擇性增益~Build hypothetical target/barrier removal matrices and separate rate gain from selectivity gain | 分子與分母都變動時選擇比需重算~Selectivity must be recalculated when either rate changes | 只看目標膜速率判斷選擇性~Judging selectivity from the target-film rate alone
過濾取捨~Filtration tradeoff | 畫進出濾器的尾端粒數和有效磨粒濃度，計算兩者回收率~Plot tail counts and useful abrasive concentrations before/after filtration and calculate recovery | 去除團聚物也可能改變有效磨粒族群~Removing agglomerates can also change useful abrasive populations | 把濾後越少顆粒一律視為越好~Treating fewer particles after filtration as universally better
循環剪切~Recirculation shear | 設計循環前後及停機後的取樣時間線，分辨剪切與靜置效應~Plan samples before/after circulation and after stoppage to separate shear from aging | 輸送歷史會影響顆粒狀態~Delivery history can affect particle state | 用出廠一次量測代表整個使用期間~Using a factory measurement for the entire use period
取樣污染~Sampling contamination | 畫容器空白、管線空白和真樣品三條流程，辨識外加顆粒~Map bottle blank, line blank and real-sample flows to identify added particles | 容器與取樣管本身會引入訊號~Containers and sampling lines can introduce signals | 未扣除空白就歸咎漿料批次~Blaming slurry lots without checking blanks
氧化劑老化~Oxidizer aging | 用假設活性隨時間曲線規劃配製時間、使用時間和化學檢查欄位~Use a hypothetical activity-time curve to plan preparation, use and chemistry checks | 化學活性變化不一定反映在粒徑~Chemical activity changes need not appear in particle size | 以粒徑未變證明全部化學性質未變~Treating stable size as proof of unchanged chemistry
缺陷對位~Defect registration | 將大粒事件時間與晶圓刮傷位置配對，保留未對上的樣本~Align large-particle event times with scratch maps and retain unmatched samples | 相關性需排除墊與清洗等混雜因素~Correlation must account for pad and cleaning confounders | 一次同時出現就宣稱因果確立~Declaring causation from one coincidence
批次放行~Lot release | 建立粒徑尾端、濃度、化學活性與试片缺陷的共同放行表~Build a joint release record for distribution tails, concentration, activity and coupon defects | 放行應使用多項與失效相關的證據~Release requires several failure-relevant evidence types | 只以供應商品名相同視為批次等效~Assuming equivalent lots from the same product name
''')
lessons('a069', '''
電子流與原子遷移~Electron flow and atomic transport | 畫導線的電子流、傳統電流及可能原子通量，分清方向定義~Draw electron flow, conventional current and possible atomic flux with explicit conventions | 原子通量與通量散度不是同一量~Atomic flux and its divergence are different quantities | 只畫電流箭頭便確定所有空洞位置~Locating every void from a current arrow alone
電流密度~Current density | 對兩種截面計算 J=I/A，並分別記錄總電流與截面~Calculate J=I/A for two cross-sections while recording current and area separately | 相同電流不代表相同電流密度~Equal current does not imply equal current density | 用額定電流直接比較不同線寬壽命~Comparing different widths by rated current alone
通孔擁擠~Via current crowding | 畫線轉通孔轉角的等流線，圈出幾何擁擠和局部熱點~Draw streamlines at a line-to-via turn and identify crowding and hotspots | 平均 J 可能低估局部應力~Average J can underestimate local stress | 把整段均勻 J 當成通孔最壞值~Using uniform line J as the worst via value
焦耳熱~Joule heating | 自訂電阻及電流算 I²R，畫電熱回授並要求獨立溫度量測~Calculate hypothetical I²R, sketch electrothermal feedback and require temperature evidence | 試件溫度可能高於載台溫度~Specimen temperature may exceed chuck temperature | 以載台設定值取代導線實際溫度~Replacing conductor temperature with the chuck setpoint
加速模型~Acceleration model | 以假設 n 與活化能比較 Black 模型壽命比，所有溫度轉為 K~Compare Black-model life ratios with hypothetical n and activation energy using kelvin | 外推需要機制及參數適用性~Extrapolation requires valid mechanisms and parameters | 把攝氏值直接放入 Arrhenius 指數~Putting Celsius directly into an Arrhenius exponent
長度效應~Length effect | 畫短線兩端受限的背應力，比較不同 J×L 教學案例~Draw back stress in a constrained short line and compare hypothetical J×L cases | 機械邊界會影響淨原子遷移~Mechanical boundaries affect net atomic transport | 認為短線只因電阻低而必然不失效~Assuming short lines never fail merely because resistance is low
微結構~Microstructure | 比較晶界、介面與晶粒內路徑，為各路徑標記可觀察證據~Compare grain-boundary, interface and bulk paths with observable evidence | 最快擴散路徑依材料與結構而異~The fastest diffusion path depends on material and structure | 宣稱所有金屬都由同一擴散路徑主導~Assigning the same dominant path to all metals
失效準則~Failure criterion | 在假設電阻時間曲線標出噪聲、漂移與事先定義的失效門檻~Mark noise, drift and a predeclared failure threshold on resistance-time traces | 門檻改變會改變報告壽命~Changing the threshold changes reported lifetime | 看完數據才挑最有利的門檻~Selecting a favorable threshold after viewing data
截尾樣本~Censored specimens | 建立失效及到期未失效樣本表，保留應力時間與狀態~Tabulate failed and still-surviving specimens with stress time and status | 未失效樣本提供壽命下界而非無限壽命~Survivors give lower bounds rather than infinite life | 把未失效樣本從統計中刪除~Deleting surviving samples from statistics
失效分析~Failure analysis | 將電阻突變對應空洞、裂紋和接觸異常三種假說，列出區分影像~Compare void, crack and contact-fault hypotheses for a resistance jump and specify discriminating images | 電性失效不能獨自證明電遷移機制~Electrical failure alone does not prove electromigration | 所有開路都直接分類為電遷移~Classifying every open circuit as electromigration
設計修正~Design revision | 比較加寬線、增加通孔與改善散熱對 J、R、溫度的共同影響~Compare widening, extra vias and cooling for effects on J, R and temperature | 改善須連到實際瓶頸而非單一尺寸~Improvements must target the actual bottleneck, not one dimension | 通孔加倍就假定壽命固定加倍~Assuming twice the vias always doubles lifetime
使用情境~Use-condition transfer | 將測試直流負载與產品脈衝工作週期分開，列出不能直接外推的部分~Separate DC stress from pulsed duty cycles and list unsupported extrapolations | 峰值、平均值與熱時間尺度不能互換~Peak, average and thermal time scale are not interchangeable | 只匹配平均電流就宣稱情境等效~Declaring equivalent conditions from average current alone
''')
lessons('a070', '''
電場與厚度~Field and thickness | 用假設 V、t 算 E=V/t 並標註均勻平板近似~Calculate E=V/t from hypothetical values and state the uniform planar approximation | 端點及多層介質的局部場可能不同~Edge and multilayer local fields may differ | 直接用總堆疊厚度推斷每層相同電場~Inferring equal field in every layer from total thickness
應力模式~Stress modes | 並列定電壓與定電流應力的控制量、響應及失效判準~Compare controlled variables, responses and failure criteria for voltage and current stress | 不同應力模式會產生不同能量歷史~Different stress modes produce different energy histories | 將定電流和定電壓時間直接混為同分布~Pooling constant-current and constant-voltage times
初始漏電~Initial leakage | 畫初始 I-V 並加入量測地板，區分漏電數值與低於解析度~Draw initial I-V with a measurement floor and separate measured leakage from unresolved values | 低於儀器地板不能寫成零漏電~Below-floor current is not zero leakage | 用顯示零值證明介電層無缺陷~Treating a displayed zero as a defect-free dielectric
軟硬崩潰~Soft and hard breakdown | 比較有階躍但仍限流與低阻短路曲線，提出兩套判準~Compare stepped leakage with current limiting against low-resistance shorting and define criteria | 軟崩潰與硬崩潰不應任意合併~Soft and hard breakdown should not be arbitrarily pooled | 把第一次任何電流波動都算硬崩潰~Calling the first current fluctuation hard breakdown
時間解析度~Time resolution | 給兩個取樣間隔判讀同一模擬崩潰事件，報告區間而非假精確時刻~Analyze one simulated event with two sampling intervals and report an interval | 事件時刻受到採樣間隔限制~Event timing is limited by sampling interval | 在稀疏採樣間填入沒有量測的精確秒數~Inventing an exact time between sparse samples
Weibull 座標~Weibull coordinates | 對假設失效時間排序，繪製 ln[-ln(1-F)] 對 ln t 並標出排名法~Rank hypothetical failures and plot ln[-ln(1-F)] against ln t with the ranking method | Weibull 斜率反映分布形状而非直接等於活化能~Weibull slope describes distribution shape, not activation energy | 把斜率直接當成 Arrhenius 活化能~Interpreting the slope as Arrhenius activation energy
面積縮放~Area scaling | 用相同製程不同面積電容比較弱點統計，註明獨立缺陷假設~Compare capacitor areas under identical processing and state independent-defect assumptions | 面積縮放需同一缺陷族群及機制~Area scaling requires the same defect population and mechanism | 用不同材料電容驗證純面積效應~Using different materials to establish a pure area effect
溫度加速~Thermal acceleration | 固定電場比較兩溫度壽命，分辨機制轉換與熱加速~Compare life at two temperatures and fixed field, checking for mechanism changes | 溫度外推不能跨越未知機制轉換~Temperature extrapolation cannot ignore mechanism transitions | 所有溫度點強迫共用一條直線~Forcing all temperatures onto one line
電壓加速~Voltage acceleration | 比較兩種候選電場加速模型在測試區和使用區的預測差~Compare two field-acceleration models within test and use ranges | 測試區擬合接近不代表遠端外推相同~Similar in-range fits need not extrapolate alike | 只以最大 R² 選定終身壽命模型~Choosing a lifetime model solely by maximum R²
量測回路~Measurement circuit | 畫寄生電容、串聯電阻及限流，辨識崩潰瞬間能量來源~Draw parasitic capacitance, resistance and compliance and identify transient energy sources | 儀器限流不會立即消除已儲存電能~Compliance does not instantly remove stored electrical energy | 把限流設定當成任何瞬間都無超調~Assuming compliance guarantees no transient overshoot
缺陷與製程~Defects and processing | 將粒子、厚度薄點與電極邊緣列為假說，規劃分組電容版圖~List particles, thin spots and electrode edges as hypotheses and design split structures | 幾何及污染會混合內在與外在失效~Geometry and contamination mix intrinsic and extrinsic failures | 所有早期失效都視為材料本徵壽命~Calling all early failures intrinsic material lifetime
可靠度報告~Reliability report | 整合樣本數、截尾、失效定義、模型和不確定區間的審查表~Combine sample count, censoring, criterion, model and uncertainty in a review sheet | 單一最佳估計不足以表達壽命可信度~One best estimate does not express lifetime confidence | 只報最長未失效時間作為保證~Reporting only the longest survivor as a guarantee
''')
lessons('a071', '''
1T1C 儲存~One-transistor one-capacitor storage | 畫存取電晶體、儲存電容與位元線並追蹤寫入讀出~Draw access transistor, capacitor and bitline and trace write/read paths | 讀出擾動儲存電荷並需要恢復~Readout disturbs stored charge and requires restoration | 把 DRAM 讀取當成完全不改變電容電荷~Treating DRAM read as entirely nondisturbing
電容預算~Capacitance budget | 用 C=εA/t 比較面積、介電常數與厚度三種假設改善~Use C=εA/t to compare hypothetical area, permittivity and thickness changes | 薄介電層的電容收益必須和漏電一起評估~Capacitance gains from thinning require leakage assessment | 只把介電層無限變薄當成可行最佳解~Treating unlimited dielectric thinning as feasible optimization
立體表面~Three-dimensional surface | 畫杯狀電容的內外表面，計算可利用面積而非只算底面~Sketch inner/outer cup surfaces and count usable area rather than footprint alone | 垂直結構以高度換取表面面積~Vertical structures exchange height for surface area | 以平面占地直接等同電極面積~Equating footprint directly with electrode area
高深寬比開口~High-aspect-ratio openings | 將顶部、中部和底部寬度標在假設剖面，計算各段收縮~Mark top, middle and bottom widths on a hypothetical section and quantify narrowing | 孔口尺寸不能完整描述深孔形貌~Opening CD does not fully describe a deep feature | 量到孔口正確就判定整孔合格~Accepting the whole hole from the opening CD
側壁共形性~Sidewall conformality | 比較入口與底部膜厚，定義覆蓋率並標出量測位置~Compare entrance/bottom thickness, define coverage and mark measurement sites | 表面限制反應仍需足夠前驅物流入深處~Surface-limited reactions still need precursor access to depth | 把 ALD 名稱當成百分百深孔均勻的保證~Treating the ALD label as guaranteed deep-hole uniformity
下電極連續性~Bottom-electrode continuity | 畫斷裂與完整電極兩種路徑，規劃電阻與截面交叉檢查~Draw broken/continuous electrodes and plan resistance plus cross-sectional checks | 局部斷膜可能隔離部分有效面積~A film break can isolate useful area | 只看外觀連續便推定電流路徑完整~Assuming electrical continuity from exterior appearance
機械支撐~Mechanical support | 畫高柱電容與支撐層，判斷移除犧牲層後的倒塌風險~Sketch tall capacitors and supports and assess collapse after sacrificial removal | 高度增加同時提高機械整合難度~Greater height also raises mechanical integration difficulty | 只加高電容而忽略結構支撐~Increasing height without considering support
高介電界面~High-k interfaces | 畫電极與高介電膜間串聯介面層，計算等效電容~Draw interfacial layers in series with high-k and calculate effective capacitance | 低電容介面層可限制整體電容~A low-capacitance interface can limit the whole stack | 把材料本體 κ 直接當作元件有效 κ~Equating bulk kappa with device-effective kappa
漏電保持~Leakage and retention | 以假設 Q=CV 和漏電 I 估算 Δt=ΔQ/I 的理想化保持時間~Estimate idealized Δt=ΔQ/I using hypothetical Q=CV and leakage | 保持時間取決於可容許電荷損失與漏電~Retention depends on allowable charge loss and leakage | 只比較電容大小而忽略漏電~Comparing retention by capacitance alone
寄生耦合~Parasitic coupling | 畫相鄰儲存節點，對一次位元線切換標示可能耦合路徑~Draw neighboring storage nodes and coupling during a bitline transition | 鄰近導體使節點電位受到非預期影響~Neighboring conductors can perturb node voltage | 假定每顆電容在陣列中完全孤立~Assuming every array capacitor is isolated
分布尾端~Distribution tails | 比較同平均保持時間但不同短保持尾端的兩批假設資料~Compare hypothetical lots with equal mean retention but different short-retention tails | 最弱儲存單元可能支配刷新要求~Weak cells can dominate refresh requirements | 用平均保持時間設定全陣列刷新~Setting array refresh from mean retention alone
電容整合審查~Capacitor integration review | 把電容、漏電、深孔形貌、電極連通與機械支撐放入證據矩陣~Combine capacitance, leakage, profile, continuity and support in an evidence matrix | 電性與結構證據需相互對應~Electrical and structural evidence must correspond | 只展示漂亮截面就宣稱記憶體功能合格~Claiming functional memory from an attractive section
''')
lessons('a072', '''
垂直字串~Vertical strings | 畫穿過多層字線的通道並標示選擇閘和每層記憶單元~Draw a channel through stacked wordlines with select gates and per-layer cells | 堆疊層數不同於每顆單元可儲存位元數~Layer count differs from bits stored per cell | 把 3D 層數當成單元位元數~Equating stack layers with bits per cell
交替薄膜~Alternating films | 畫兩材料交替堆疊，追蹤累積厚度誤差與應力方向~Draw alternating films and track accumulated thickness error and stress | 小的每層偏差可能累積成整體偏差~Small per-layer errors can accumulate | 只驗第一層就視為整堆疊等效~Qualifying an entire stack from the first layer
晶圓彎曲~Wafer bow | 對稱與非對稱應力堆疊各畫曲率，加入背面補償的假设~Sketch bow for symmetric/asymmetric stress stacks and a hypothetical backside compensation | 補償平均曲率不能保證局部應力消失~Compensating mean curvature does not remove all local stress | 晶圓外觀變平就宣稱每層無應力~Calling every layer stress-free after flattening
深孔輪廓~Deep-hole profile | 比較理想、彎曲與扭轉孔剖面，標出頂中底 CD~Compare ideal, bowed and twisted hole sections with top/middle/bottom CD | 高深寬比蝕刻可能出現多種形貌異常~High-aspect-ratio etching can produce different profile failures | 所有深孔異常只用深度一項描述~Describing all deep-hole failures by depth alone
階梯接點~Staircase contacts | 畫每層字線露出的階梯與接點，檢查是否唯一連到目標層~Draw exposed staircase wordlines and verify unique contacts to target layers | 垂直層仍需可尋址的電性出口~Vertical layers still need addressable electrical connections | 認為只加堆疊便不需增加連接複雜度~Assuming more layers add no connection complexity
閘極取代~Replacement gates | 紙上依序移除犧牲材料和填入導體，圈出需保留的絕緣~On paper remove sacrificial material and add conductor while preserving required insulation | 選擇性移除和填充共同限制字線連續性~Selective removal and fill jointly limit wordline continuity | 移除越徹底就一定不傷其餘層~Assuming more aggressive removal cannot damage other layers
通道連續~Channel continuity | 畫通道膜沿深孔側壁的接續並辨識底部與接合區缺口~Trace channel film down a hole and identify bottom/junction gaps | 垂直導通需要整段連續的通道路徑~Vertical conduction requires a continuous channel path | 只測頂部膜厚就保證整串導通~Guaranteeing string conduction from top thickness
多堆疊接合~Multiple-deck junctions | 畫上下兩疊孔的偏移與縮頸，追蹤最窄通道位置~Draw offset and necking between two decks and locate the narrowest passage | 分段堆疊降低單次深度但新增接合誤差~Deck splitting lowers per-etch depth but adds junction error | 兩疊技術只增加層數而沒有新介面~Assuming two decks add layers without new interfaces
臨界電壓窗~Threshold windows | 畫多位元單元的假設電壓分布與讀取門檻，檢查重疊~Draw hypothetical multi-bit threshold distributions and read thresholds and inspect overlap | 多狀態儲存壓縮單一狀態的容許裕量~More states reduce the margin allocated to each state | 位元數增加而每個狀態裕量保持不變~Increasing bits while assuming unchanged per-state margin
擾動路徑~Disturb pathways | 分開選定字線、通過字線與鄰近字線的偏壓角色~Separate selected, pass and neighboring wordline bias roles | 未被選中的單元仍可能承受電場~Unselected cells can still experience electric fields | 未選中就完全不受讀寫影響~Assuming unselected means unaffected by reads/writes
陣列與周邊~Array and periphery | 比較陣列下 CMOS 與分層接合架構，畫訊號與熱預算依賴~Compare CMOS-under-array and bonded tiers with signal and thermal dependencies | 周邊電路位置影響整合順序及互連~Peripheral placement affects process order and interconnects | 所有 3D NAND 都有相同周邊配置~Assuming identical periphery in every 3D NAND
良率地圖~Yield map | 以層號與字串位置建立失效熱圖，分辨層相關與孔相關模式~Build a failure map by layer and string location to separate layer and hole patterns | 單一晶圓二維圖可能隱藏深度資訊~A two-dimensional wafer map can hide depth information | 只保留每顆晶片一個合格旗標~Retaining only one pass/fail flag per die
''')
lessons('a073', '''
電荷儲存層~Charge-storage layer | 畫通道、穿隧層、捕捉層、阻擋層及閘極，標示電荷位置~Draw channel, tunnel, trap, blocking layers and gate with charge locations | 電荷捕捉層和導電浮閘的儲存方式不同~Charge-trap layers store charge differently from conductive floating gates | 把捕捉層畫成等電位金屬浮閘~Drawing a trap layer as an equipotential metallic floating gate
閘極耦合~Gate coupling | 以串聯電容圖分配各層電壓，標註面積與介電常數~Use a series-capacitor diagram to divide voltage across layers with area and permittivity | 外加閘壓不全部降在穿隧層~Not all gate voltage falls across the tunnel layer | 以總閘壓除穿隧層厚度直接算電場~Dividing total gate voltage by tunnel thickness without voltage division
注入與釋放~Injection and release | 畫編程和抹除時的載子方向，保留能障與極性定義~Sketch carrier direction during program/erase with barrier and polarity conventions | 編程與抹除須連到實際能帶條件~Program and erase must be tied to band conditions | 只改文字標籤不改電場方向~Changing labels without changing field direction
捕捉位置~Trap location | 比較靠近通道與靠近閘極的捕捉電荷對臨界電壓影響~Compare near-channel and near-gate trapped charge effects on threshold | 同樣電荷量不同位置可能有不同耦合~Equal charge at different positions can couple differently | 假定只要總電荷相同 ΔVt 必相同~Assuming equal total charge always gives equal ΔVt
能階深度~Trap depth | 畫淺與深捕捉能階的釋放路徑，分開快速暫態與長期保持~Draw release paths for shallow/deep traps and separate transients from retention | 捕捉態分布影響時間與溫度響應~Trap distributions affect time and temperature response | 只用單一捕捉能階代表所有保持尾端~Using one trap level for all retention tails
穿隧層厚度~Tunnel thickness | 比較薄層編程便利與保持障壁，列出待量測的兩項結果~Compare programming access versus retention barrier and specify both measurements | 讀寫速度與保持常有相反設計壓力~Write speed and retention often impose opposing demands | 穿隧層越薄一定在所有指標更好~Assuming a thinner tunnel layer improves every metric
阻擋層~Blocking layer | 畫往閘極的非預期漏電路徑，與通道注入路徑分色~Distinguish unwanted gate-side leakage from channel injection | 阻擋層服務的界面不同於穿隧層~The blocking layer serves a different interface from the tunnel layer | 互換兩層而假定能帶條件不變~Swapping the layers while assuming unchanged bands
橫向遷移~Lateral migration | 畫相鄰單元沿連續捕捉層的電荷再分布，比較隔離假說~Draw possible charge redistribution along a continuous trap layer and compare isolation hypotheses | 局部儲存不代表完全沒有橫向傳輸~Localized storage does not imply zero lateral transport | 只要叫電荷捕捉便不存在鄰近耦合~Assuming charge trapping eliminates all neighbor interactions
增量編程~Incremental programming | 對自訂目標窗模擬小步脈衝與驗證，計算過衝與迭代次數~Simulate small programming increments and verification for a hypothetical target window | 驗證回授以時間成本換取狀態控制~Verification feedback trades time for state control | 單次固定脈衝可忽略單元差異~Assuming one fixed pulse eliminates cell variation
循環損傷~Cycling damage | 比較循環前後漏電與電壓窗，將新缺陷和原始捕捉態分開~Compare leakage/windows before and after cycling, distinguishing generated defects | 操作累積可能改變介電層而非只改儲存電荷~Cycling can alter the dielectric, not only stored charge | 抹除能回復全部材料損傷~Assuming erase reverses all material damage
讀擾與保持~Read disturb and retention | 設計相同等待時間但不同讀次數的對照，隔離讀擾~Compare equal waiting times with different read counts to isolate read disturb | 時間老化與讀取擾動需要不同對照~Time aging and read disturbance require different controls | 將所有 ΔVt 漂移歸因於等待時間~Attributing every threshold shift to elapsed time
記憶窗驗收~Memory-window acceptance | 以初始、循環後及保持後三組分布設定有證據的讀取裕量~Set evidence-based read margins using initial, cycled and retained distributions | 平均記憶窗不能代表最弱單元裕量~Mean window does not represent weakest-cell margin | 只用兩個平均電壓差證明零錯誤~Claiming zero errors from two mean voltages
''')
lessons('a074', '''
相態与電阻~Phase and resistance | 畫晶態及非晶態原子示意，連結到兩組假設電阻分布~Sketch crystalline/amorphous arrangements and connect them to resistance distributions | 電阻對比來自材料狀態而非永久斷路~Resistance contrast reflects material state, not necessarily permanent rupture | 把高阻態都視為燒斷導線~Treating every high-resistance state as a burnt wire
SET 與 RESET~SET and RESET | 畫結晶保溫與熔融後快冷的概念溫度時間曲線~Draw conceptual crystallizing dwell and melt-quench temperature trajectories | 峰值溫度與冷卻歷史共同決定相態~Peak temperature and cooling history jointly determine phase | 只比較最大脈衝幅度判斷最終相態~Judging final phase from maximum pulse amplitude alone
加熱器幾何~Heater geometry | 比較小接觸與大接觸的熱集中位置並標示电流路徑~Compare heat localization for small/large contacts and mark current paths | 加熱效率與有效相變體積相關~Heating efficiency relates to active phase-change volume | 只以整顆元件體積計算切換能量~Estimating switching energy from total device volume alone
熱阻網路~Thermal network | 畫相變層到電極及基板的熱阻，計算假設穩態溫升~Draw thermal paths to electrodes/substrate and estimate hypothetical steady rise | 熱侷限有助加熱但也影響冷卻~Thermal confinement aids heating but also affects cooling | 熱阻越高就保證 RESET 越容易~Assuming higher thermal resistance always simplifies RESET
脈衝能量~Pulse energy | 對假設 V(t)、I(t) 做能量積分，分辨峰值功率與總能量~Integrate hypothetical V(t)I(t) and distinguish peak power from total energy | 相同能量不同時間形狀可形成不同溫度軌跡~Equal energies with different shapes can yield different thermal histories | 相同焦耳數就必有相同材料狀態~Equating joules with identical material states
材料組成~Material composition | 比較兩種假設組成的結晶速度、保持與漂移需求表~Compare hypothetical compositions for crystallization speed, retention and drift | 材料選擇同時受切換與穩定性約束~Materials are constrained by switching and stability together | 只追求最快結晶而忽略非晶保持~Optimizing crystallization speed while ignoring amorphous retention
受限相變體積~Confined active volume | 畫蘑菇型與受限結構的熱區，將有效區和外圍材料分色~Draw mushroom/confined thermal regions and separate active from surrounding material | 外圍材料未必每次都完成相變~Surrounding material need not transform each cycle | 把全部沉積材料當成每次都重熔~Assuming all deposited material remelts each cycle
電阻漂移~Resistance drift | 用自訂 R=R0(t/t0)^ν 比較兩個 ν，標明模型及時間窗~Compare two hypothetical drift exponents using R=R0(t/t0)^ν with a time window | 讀取時間不同會影響相同初態的電阻~Read timing affects resistance even for identical initial states | 用不同延遲電阻比較寫入一致性~Comparing write consistency at different read delays
多位準~Multilevel states | 畫部分結晶的三個假設電阻窗，加入漂移和讀取雜訊~Draw three partial-crystallization windows including drift and read noise | 可分辨狀態數受漂移與變異共同限制~Distinguishable states are limited by drift and variability | 初始分開就保證長期不重疊~Assuming initial separation guarantees permanent separation
選擇器與偷流~Selector and sneak paths | 畫一個交叉點陣列，追蹤選中路徑與未選中旁路~Draw a cross-point array and trace selected and sneak paths | 選擇器與記憶材料的職責不同~Selectors and storage material serve different roles | 將 OTS 閾值切換直接等同 PCM 相變~Equating OTS threshold switching directly with PCM phase change
過度編程~Over-programming | 比較達標即停與過強 RESET 的假設循環圖，列出偏析證據~Compare stop-on-target and excessive RESET cycling and specify segregation evidence | 更大寫入能量可能加速材料劣化~Greater write energy can accelerate material degradation | 高阻態越高就一定壽命越長~Assuming higher RESET resistance guarantees longer life
陣列耐久度~Array endurance | 將平均值、早失效尾端和測試中未失效樣本同時報告~Report means, early-failure tails and surviving array cells together | 單元展示和整陣列可靠度證據不同~Single-cell demonstrations and array reliability are different evidence | 挑最佳單元的次數代表所有位元~Using the best cell's cycle count for every bit
''')
lessons('a075', '''
MTJ 分層~MTJ stack | 畫參考層、穿隧障壁及自由層，標出讀寫端點~Draw reference layer, barrier and free layer with read/write terminals | 穿隧電阻取決於相對磁化狀態~Tunnel resistance depends on relative magnetization | 只標自由層方向而不定義參考層~Specifying free-layer direction without a reference layer
TMR 定義~TMR definition | 以假設 RP、RAP 計算 (RAP-RP)/RP 並註明慣例~Compute (RAP-RP)/RP from hypothetical values with the convention stated | 電阻比的分母必須一致~The resistance-ratio denominator must be consistent | 不註明分母便比較不同 TMR 百分比~Comparing TMR percentages without denominator conventions
磁各向異性~Magnetic anisotropy | 畫平面及垂直磁化的能量井，連結面積縮放需求~Draw energy wells for in-plane/perpendicular magnetization and relate them to scaling | 易軸方向與能障都影響狀態穩定~Easy-axis direction and barrier affect state stability | 只因磁層存在就假設狀態永久穩定~Assuming a magnetic film guarantees permanent stability
熱穩定因子~Thermal stability factor | 用假設 Δ=Eb/(kBT) 比較體積及溫度改變~Compare hypothetical Δ=Eb/(kBT) under volume and temperature changes | 保持與熱擾動相關，不能只看寫入成功~Retention depends on thermal fluctuation, not just write success | 室溫一次寫入成功就保證高溫保持~Inferring hot retention from one room-temperature write
STT 路徑~STT pathway | 畫穿過障壁的寫入電流與讀電流，分出各自应力~Draw write and read currents through the barrier and distinguish stresses | STT 讀寫共享接面須處理讀擾~Shared STT read/write junctions require read-disturb control | 讀取電流永遠不可能擾動磁化~Assuming read current can never disturb magnetization
SOT 路徑~SOT pathway | 畫平面 SOT 軌和垂直讀路徑，計算假設足跡面積~Draw lateral SOT track and vertical read path and calculate a hypothetical footprint | 分離讀寫可增加端點與佈線需求~Separated read/write can increase terminals and routing needs | SOT 與 STT 可以不改版圖直接互換~Swapping SOT and STT without layout changes
障壁均勻度~Barrier uniformity | 比較均勻障壁和局部薄點的電流路徑，規劃 RA 分布量測~Compare uniform barrier/local thin spots and plan resistance-area distributions | 局部薄點可能支配穿隧與崩潰~Thin spots can dominate tunneling and breakdown | 平均厚度相同便推定障壁電性等效~Assuming equal average thickness means equivalent electrical barriers
圖形邊緣~Patterned edges | 畫蝕刻後柱壁損傷和金屬再沉積，區分磁性與漏電異常~Sketch sidewall damage/redeposition and separate magnetic from leakage faults | 柱邊緣整合可能同時改變磁性和絕緣~Pillar-edge processing can affect magnetism and insulation | 只量柱徑就證明 MTJ 品質~Proving MTJ quality from pillar diameter alone
熱預算~Thermal budget | 把磁堆疊退火與後续製程溫度排入流程，追蹤界面變化~Place stack anneal and later heating in a sequence and track interface changes | 後續熱歷史也是 MTJ 整合的一部分~Later heating is part of MTJ integration | 初次退火合格便忽略後续热步驟~Ignoring later heating after an initial passing anneal
寫錯機率~Write-error probability | 對假設脈衝重複實驗計算錯誤率並報樣本數~Compute errors from repeated hypothetical pulses with sample count | 未觀察錯誤不等於錯誤機率為零~Observing no errors does not imply zero error probability | 十次成功就宣稱任意低錯誤率~Claiming arbitrarily low error rates from ten successes
读窗與擾動~Read window and disturb | 比較兩阻態分布、放大器誤差及讀取幅度，找共同裕量~Compare state distributions, amplifier error and read amplitude for joint margin | 提高讀訊號也可能提高接面應力~Increasing read signal can increase junction stress | 只放大讀電流而不檢查讀擾~Raising read current without checking disturb
記憶體用途~Memory application | 對快取與長期儲存分別列出速度、保持、耐久與面積權重~Weight speed, retention, endurance and area separately for cache and storage | 不同用途下最佳磁記憶體架構可不同~The best magnetic-memory architecture depends on use | 一項最低能量記錄證明所有用途最佳~Treating one energy record as best for every use
''')
lessons('a076', '''
阻變截面~Resistive-switching section | 畫兩電極與氧化物，標出細絲型假說及不適用的均勻模型~Draw electrodes/oxide and label filamentary assumptions versus uniform switching | 不同 RRAM 材料系統未必使用同一機制~Different RRAM material systems need not share one mechanism | 把所有阻變元件都視為金屬熔斷~Treating all resistive switches as metal fuses
形成步驟~Electroforming | 畫初始形成與後续 SET 的差異，列出電流限制與初態證據~Distinguish initial forming from later SET and specify current limits and initial-state evidence | 首次形成歷史會影響後續切換~Initial forming history can influence later switching | 把形成和所有後續寫入視為相同初態~Assuming forming and subsequent writes start identically
電流限制~Current compliance | 以假設串聯晶體管和寄生電容畫形成過衝路徑~Draw forming overshoot paths with a hypothetical transistor and parasitic capacitance | 設定限流不能取代瞬態電流驗證~A compliance setting does not replace transient verification | 只記 SMU 限流值便保證細絲尺寸一致~Guaranteeing identical filaments from an SMU limit alone
氧空缺~Oxygen vacancies | 分色畫氧離子與空缺遷移，保持電荷與方向定義~Color-code oxygen ions and vacancies with charge/direction conventions | 氧交換界面可改變可用缺陷族群~Oxygen-exchange interfaces can change available defect populations | 把空缺畫成與氧離子相同方向的同一顆粒~Treating vacancies and oxygen ions as the same moving particle
SET 與 RESET~SET and RESET | 在假設 I-V 曲線標出高低阻態轉換和極性~Mark high/low resistance transitions and polarity on hypothetical I-V | 雙極性與單極性分類需依實際偏壓行為~Bipolar/unipolar classification requires actual bias behavior | 只依材料名稱決定所有切換極性~Inferring all switching polarity from material name
細絲侷部性~Filament locality | 比較面積縮放前後的假設電流，測試局部與均勻模型~Compare hypothetical area-scaled current to test local versus uniform models | 面積依賴是機制證據之一但不是唯一證明~Area dependence is evidence, not sole proof, of mechanism | 一個面积點就斷定電流完全局部化~Inferring full localization from one area point
循環與元件變異~Cycle and device variability | 將每元件多循環結果分成器件間和循環間分布~Separate device-to-device and cycle-to-cycle distributions | 兩種變異需不同的實驗層級~These variability sources require different experimental levels | 把同一元件多次讀取當成多顆獨立元件~Counting repeated reads as independent devices
保持尾端~Retention tails | 比較相同平均阻值但不同早衰細絲比例的兩組資料~Compare equal-mean resistance populations with different early-decay tails | 少數不穩定狀態可支配陣列保持~A small unstable population can dominate array retention | 只追蹤典型位元而忽略尾端~Tracking typical bits while ignoring tails
隨機電報雜訊~Random telegraph noise | 畫兩電平跳動與緩慢漂移，設計取樣間隔和觀察窗~Draw two-level switching versus slow drift and choose sampling/time windows | 離散跳動與連續漂移有不同判讀~Discrete jumps and continuous drift need different interpretation | 把所有電流波動平均掉再判斷讀窗~Averaging away all fluctuations before checking read margins
寫入驗證~Program and verify | 對自訂導電目標窗模擬逐次寫入與讀取，記錄不收斂情況~Simulate write/read iterations toward a conductance window and record nonconvergence | 回授可縮小誤差但不能保證每個位元都收斂~Feedback reduces error but does not guarantee convergence | 無限重試而沒有失败出口~Retrying indefinitely without a failure exit
交叉陣列~Crossbar array | 用小型電阻矩陣計算理想列電流，再加入線阻和偷流~Compute ideal column current for a small conductance matrix, then add line resistance/sneak paths | 陣列輸出不只由單元導電值決定~Array output depends on more than cell conductance | 單元線性就假定整陣列乘法精確~Assuming linear cells guarantee exact array multiplication
權重漂移~Weight drift | 比較儲存後權重與參考權重，設定由誤差觸發的校驗策略~Compare aged/reference weights and define error-triggered verification | 類比運算誤差需要系統層級驗證~Analog-compute error needs system-level verification | 只看元件阻態仍分開就保證推論準確~Guaranteeing inference accuracy from separated device states
''')
lessons('a077', '''
晶相與鐵電性~Phase and ferroelectricity | 對單斜、四方及正交相畫分類表，分開結構證據與電性證據~Classify monoclinic, tetragonal and orthorhombic phases with structural/electrical evidence | 氧化鉿存在不等於已形成鐵電相~The presence of hafnia does not establish a ferroelectric phase | 只量化學成分就宣稱鐵電性~Claiming ferroelectricity from composition alone
極化迴圈~Polarization loops | 畫理想極化與含漏電的積分電荷迴圈，比較可混淆訊號~Compare ideal polarization with leakage-contaminated integrated-charge loops | 漏電可讓電荷迴圈看似有鐵電遲滯~Leakage can make charge loops resemble ferroelectric hysteresis | 任何封閉 I-V 積分迴圈都當鐵電證明~Treating every closed integrated loop as ferroelectric proof
PUND 差分~PUND differencing | 畫同極性切換與不切換脈衝，標示相減得到的切換電荷~Draw switching/non-switching pulses and subtract their charges | 差分脈衝需控制非切換背景的可比性~Pulse subtraction requires comparable nonswitching backgrounds | 不同脈寬仍直接相減當切換電荷~Subtracting unmatched pulse widths as switching charge
厚度與場~Thickness and field | 將假設施加電壓轉為場，分開物理膜厚與介面分壓~Convert hypothetical voltage to field while separating film thickness/interface division | 相同電壓對不同膜厚並非相同應力~Equal voltage across different thicknesses is not equal stress | 用電壓相同就宣稱不同厚度測試公平~Claiming fair thickness comparison from equal voltage
摻雜與比例~Dopants and composition | 以假設 Hf/Zr 比例矩陣規劃結構、極化和漏電共同量測~Plan structural, polarization and leakage measurements over hypothetical Hf/Zr ratios | 相穩定化和漏電必須共同評估~Phase stabilization and leakage need joint assessment | 只最大化剩餘極化而不看漏電~Maximizing remanence without examining leakage
電極與應力~Electrodes and stress | 畫上下電極夾持及熱膨脹差，列出退火前後量測~Draw electrode constraint/thermal mismatch and specify before/after anneal checks | 電極不只是導線，也影響界面與機械邊界~Electrodes also affect interfaces and mechanical boundaries | 更換電極只計算片電阻變化~Considering only sheet resistance when changing electrodes
氧交換介面~Oxygen-exchange interfaces | 畫電極與 HZO 間氧交換方向，提出相組成及缺陷兩種驗證~Draw oxygen exchange across HZO/electrode interfaces and propose phase/defect checks | 改變氧環境可能同時改變晶相和缺陷~Oxygen conditions can alter both phase and defects | 所有氧空缺減少都必然改善全部性能~Assuming fewer oxygen vacancies improve every property
喚醒效應~Wake-up effect | 畫前幾輪循環極化增加的假設曲線，和儀器穩定化對照~Draw hypothetical early-cycle polarization growth and compare instrument settling | 喚醒與測量暫態需要區分~Wake-up must be distinguished from measurement transients | 第一次較小就當永久性製程失敗~Treating a small first cycle as permanent process failure
疲勞與印記~Fatigue and imprint | 分開迴圈縮小和水平位移，量化極化幅度及中心偏移~Separate loop shrinkage from horizontal shift and quantify both | 疲勞與印記描述不同退化特徵~Fatigue and imprint describe different degradation features | 用單一遲滯面積代替全部老化資訊~Replacing all aging information with loop area
FeCAP 與 FeFET~FeCAP and FeFET | 畫獨立電容讀電荷與閘極控制通道讀電流的兩種回路~Draw capacitor charge readout and ferroelectric-gated transistor current readout | FeCAP 與 FeFET 的讀取及介面要求不同~FeCAP and FeFET readout/interface requirements differ | 同一電容迴圈便完整預測 FeFET 記憶窗~Predicting a complete FeFET window from one capacitor loop
非破壞讀出~Nondestructive readout | 比較極化翻轉讀出與小訊號電容讀出，列出需驗證的擾動~Compare polarization-switching and small-signal capacitive readout with disturb checks | 非破壞讀取須驗證讀後狀態保留~Nondestructive reading requires post-read state verification | 讀出電流小就直接保證不擾動~Guaranteeing nondisturbance from small read current
整合證據~Integration evidence | 同時審查相鑑定、切換電荷、保持、循環和熱預算~Review phase evidence, switched charge, retention, cycling and thermal budget together | 研究最佳值需連同條件與分布閱讀~Research best values must be read with conditions and distributions | 將單次最佳極化當成量產可靠度~Treating best polarization as production reliability
''')
lessons('a078', '''
像素訊號鏈~Pixel signal chain | 畫光子、光電荷、轉移閘、浮接擴散與讀出放大器~Draw photons, photocharge, transfer gate, floating diffusion and amplifier | 光學收集與電性讀出是不同效率~Optical collection and electrical readout have different efficiencies | 把量子效率和電壓增益當同一指標~Equating quantum efficiency with voltage gain
前照與背照~Front versus back illumination | 畫光穿過配線前照及由背面入射兩種截面~Draw light paths through front wiring and through backside silicon | 背照改善入射路徑仍需處理表面與厚度~Back illumination changes entry paths but still needs surface/thickness control | 背照就自動消除暗電流與串擾~Assuming backside illumination eliminates dark current and crosstalk
光二極體深度~Photodiode depth | 比較不同波長吸收深度與收集區，標示復合損失~Compare wavelength-dependent absorption depths and collection regions with recombination | 吸收光子不代表其電荷全部被收集~Absorption does not guarantee complete charge collection | 將吸收率直接等同外部量子效率~Equating absorption with external quantum efficiency
暗訊號~Dark signal | 對暗場自訂曝光時間及溫度矩陣，分辨固定偏移與暗電流~Use a hypothetical exposure/temperature matrix to separate offset from dark current | 暗電流通常隨積分時間累積~Dark-current charge accumulates with integration time | 用單次黑畫面直接代表暗電流率~Treating one dark image as a dark-current rate
完整電荷轉移~Complete charge transfer | 畫轉移前後位勢井，檢查殘留電荷及影像延遲~Sketch potential wells before/after transfer and inspect residual charge and lag | 電荷轉移不完整會留下前一影像資訊~Incomplete transfer can retain previous-image information | 把延遲完全歸因於影像軟體~Attributing all lag to image software
飽和與轉換增益~Saturation and conversion gain | 用假設浮接電容算 ΔV=Q/C，比較訊號增益和容量需求~Use hypothetical floating-node capacitance to compare ΔV=Q/C and capacity | 更高電壓轉換增益不等於更高滿井容量~Higher voltage conversion gain does not imply greater full well | 用單一增益數值代表動態範圍~Representing dynamic range by gain alone
像素隔離~Pixel isolation | 畫光學與載子兩種串擾路徑，為溝槽隔離指定對照~Draw optical/carrier crosstalk paths and controls for trench isolation | 光學隔離與電荷隔離不是同一件事~Optical isolation and charge isolation differ | 電性隔離合格便推定無光學串擾~Inferring no optical crosstalk from electrical isolation
微透鏡與濾色~Microlenses and filters | 畫斜入射在邊緣像素的光路，檢查微透鏡偏移與濾色對位~Trace oblique rays at edge pixels and check microlens/filter registration | 光學堆疊對位要配合入射角~Optical-stack registration depends on incidence angle | 全畫面所有像素光學條件完全相同~Assuming identical optical conditions across the image
堆疊接口~Stacked interfaces | 分開像素、像素電晶體與邏輯層，追蹤一條跨層訊號~Separate pixel, pixel-transistor and logic layers and trace an inter-tier signal | 分層允許不同製程最佳化但增加互連要求~Separate tiers allow process optimization but add interconnect requirements | 堆疊後所有層都可完全獨立不需介面規格~Assuming stacked tiers require no interface specification
讀出時間~Readout timing | 畫逐列與同時曝光的時間圖，預測移動物體形變~Draw rolling/global exposure timing and predict moving-object distortion | 曝光同步與資料輸出順序是不同概念~Exposure synchronization differs from data-output order | 同時輸出資料就等於全域快門~Equating simultaneous output with global shutter
均勻場校正~Flat-field calibration | 用假設均勻照明影像分離暗偏移與光響應非均勻~Separate dark offset from response nonuniformity in hypothetical flat fields | 暗場扣除不能單獨消除增益不均~Dark subtraction alone cannot remove gain nonuniformity | 一張暗場可校正全部光響應差異~Using one dark frame for all response variation
感測器驗收~Sensor acceptance | 整合 QE、讀噪、滿井、壞點和串擾，保留曝光及溫度條件~Combine QE, read noise, full well, bad pixels and crosstalk with conditions | 影像品質需多條證據而非只看像素數~Image quality needs more evidence than pixel count | 畫素越多就必然弱光越好~Assuming more pixels guarantee better low-light performance
''')
lessons('a079', '''
吸收與倍增~Absorption and multiplication | 畫吸收区與高電場倍增區，追蹤一對光生載子~Draw absorption/multiplication regions and track a photogenerated pair | 光吸收與雪崩倍增可有不同空間要求~Absorption and avalanche multiplication have different spatial requirements | 把整個元件都畫成相同高場~Drawing uniform high field throughout the device
線性模式~Linear mode | 在增益對偏壓曲線標出崩潰前工作範圍~Mark the pre-breakdown operating region on a gain-bias plot | 線性 APD 增益與 Geiger 觸發不同~Linear APD gain differs from Geiger triggering | APD 有增益便必須工作在崩潰以上~Assuming gain requires above-breakdown operation
場形塑~Field shaping | 畫平面接面及邊緣曲率，說明護環如何改變局部場~Draw planar and curved junction edges and explain guard-ring field shaping | 邊緣可能先於中央發生崩潰~Edges can break down before the central region | 只用平均接面電場判斷崩潰位置~Locating breakdown from mean junction field alone
倍增雜訊~Multiplication noise | 比較同均值不同脈衝電荷變異的資料，定義額外雜訊~Compare equal-mean signals with different charge variance and define excess noise | 雪崩的隨機性會增加訊號變異~Avalanche randomness adds signal variance | 把內部增益當成完全無雜訊放大~Treating internal gain as noiseless amplification
暗電流來源~Dark-current sources | 分開表面漏電與經倍增區的體生成電流~Separate surface leakage from multiplied bulk-generated current | 並非所有暗電流都乘上相同倍增因子~Not all dark-current components share multiplication | 把全部暗電流一律乘以 M~Multiplying every dark-current component by M
溫度補償~Temperature compensation | 畫兩溫度的增益偏壓曲線，找保持相同增益的偏壓差~Draw gain-bias curves at two temperatures and find equal-gain bias differences | 溫度改變會移動增益與崩潰條件~Temperature changes gain and breakdown conditions | 固定偏壓即可保證全年固定增益~Assuming fixed bias guarantees fixed gain across temperatures
頻寬限制~Bandwidth limits | 並列 RC 時間、載子渡越與雪崩建立時間的時間常數~Compare RC, carrier transit and avalanche buildup time constants | 最慢動態環節會限制響應~The slowest dynamic process limits response | 只降低外部電阻就無限制提升速度~Assuming resistance reduction provides unlimited speed
光譜響應~Spectral response | 將不同波長吸收深度與倍增區重疊比較~Compare wavelength-dependent absorption depth with multiplication-region overlap | 有效增益與收集效率可能有光譜依賴~Effective gain and collection can depend on wavelength | 用單一波長響應代表全光譜~Using one wavelength for the entire spectrum
面積與電容~Area and capacitance | 對兩個假設接面面積比較收光、電容與暗電流~Compare collection, capacitance and dark current for two areas | 增大面積會同時改變光學與電路負載~Larger area changes both optical collection and circuit loading | 大面積在靈敏度和速度上都必然最佳~Assuming largest area is always best for sensitivity and speed
接觸與封裝~Contacts and package | 畫反射窗口、鍵合線與放大器輸入，列出寄生和遮光~Draw window, bonds and amplifier input with parasitics and shading | 封裝可限制晶片原有響應~Packaging can limit intrinsic chip response | 只看裸晶參數推定模組表現~Predicting module performance from bare-die parameters alone
增益校正~Gain calibration | 用同光通量比較低倍增參考與工作偏壓電流並扣暗電流~Compare low-gain and operating currents at equal flux with dark subtraction | 光源漂移會混入增益估計~Source drift contaminates gain estimates | 不同光強下的電流比直接當 M~Calling a ratio at different illumination the gain
偵測系統~Detection system | 合併光子雜訊、倍增雜訊與讀出雜訊，比較兩個假設增益~Combine photon, multiplication and readout noise for two gains | 最佳增益取決於整個雜訊預算~Optimal gain depends on the complete noise budget | 增益越高訊雜比永遠越好~Assuming SNR always increases with gain
''')
lessons('a080', '''
Geiger 觸發~Geiger triggering | 畫超額偏壓與雪崩觸發後的脈衝，分離光子數和脈衝幅度~Draw excess bias and triggered pulses and separate photon count from pulse height | 單像素飽和脈衝不直接量出同時光子數~A saturated pixel pulse does not directly count simultaneous photons | 用單一雪崩脈衝高度精確判斷入射光子數~Inferring exact photon number from one avalanche height
淬熄復位~Quench and reset | 畫觸發、降至崩潰以下與恢復偏壓三段時間圖~Draw trigger, below-breakdown quench and bias-recovery timing | 雪崩需要淬熄後才能可靠重新偵測~Avalanche must be quenched before reliable redetection | 只加大偏壓就能不間斷偵測~Assuming higher bias enables uninterrupted detection
偵測機率~Photon-detection probability | 分拆吸收、收集及觸發機率並區分像素 PDE 與陣列填充因子~Separate absorption, collection and trigger probabilities from array fill factor | 偵測效率定義必須說明是否包含填充因子~Efficiency definitions must state whether fill factor is included | 將不同定義 PDE 數字直接排名~Ranking PDE values with different definitions
暗計數~Dark counts | 在遮光下建立每像素計數率地圖和溫度對照~Map per-pixel dark rates under shielding with temperature controls | 暗計數是事件率而非連續暗電流~Dark count is an event rate, not continuous dark current | 以暗電流單位報告暗計數率~Reporting dark count in current units
後脈衝~Afterpulsing | 畫觸發後延遲事件直方圖，改變保持時間並比對背景~Histogram delayed events and compare holdoff settings with background | 捕捉載子釋放可形成與前次事件相關的計數~Released trapped carriers can produce correlated events | 將所有延遲事件當成獨立背景光~Treating all delayed events as independent background photons
光學串擾~Optical crosstalk | 畫鄰像素同步事件矩陣，加入遮光及距離對照~Build neighboring coincidence matrices with shielding/distance controls | 雪崩產生的光可能觸發鄰近像素~Avalanche-generated light can trigger neighbors | 同時多像素事件必然都是多個外來光子~Assuming coincidences always mean multiple incident photons
死時間~Dead time | 用假設固定死時間估算高計數壓縮，註明不可延長模型~Estimate high-rate compression with a hypothetical nonparalyzable dead-time model | 計數率增加後量測可能偏离線性~Measured count rate can become nonlinear | 將低光強線性外推到任意高光強~Extending low-flux linearity to arbitrary flux
時間抖動~Timing jitter | 畫到達時間直方圖並分拆雷射、偵測器與 TDC 貢獻~Draw arrival histograms and separate laser, detector and TDC contributions | 系統抖動不完全等於 SPAD 本體抖動~System jitter is not solely intrinsic SPAD jitter | 將總脈寬全部歸因於半導體製程~Attributing total timing width to semiconductor processing
TDC 量化~TDC quantization | 以假設分箱大小比較同一事件序列的直方圖~Bin the same hypothetical event sequence at two TDC resolutions | 分箱寬度限制可辨識的時間細節~Bin width limits resolvable timing detail | 插值畫平滑曲線就代表新增時間解析度~Treating smooth interpolation as new time resolution
直接飛行時間~Direct time of flight | 用 d=cΔt/2 算假設距離並扣除電子延遲~Compute hypothetical d=cΔt/2 after subtracting electronic delay | 往返飛行時間須除以二~Round-trip flight time requires a factor of two | 直接用 cΔt 作為單程距離~Using cΔt as one-way distance
堆疊讀出~Stacked readout | 畫 SPAD 層、計數器層及連接，檢查填充率和資料吞吐~Draw detector/counter tiers and links and check fill factor and throughput | 堆疊可改善面積配置但不消除讀出瓶頸~Stacking improves area allocation but not every readout bottleneck | 偵測器變多即保證事件資料全部送出~Assuming more pixels guarantee all events can be exported
熱點像素~Hot pixels | 制定遮罩前後影像與偵測率比較，保留被移除面積~Compare images/detection before and after masking and retain excluded area | 移除高暗計數像素也減少有效取樣~Masking high-dark pixels reduces effective sampling | 只報遮罩後最佳暗計數而不報失去像素~Reporting improved dark rate without lost pixels
''')
lessons('a081', '''
多型與基板~Polytype and substrate | 區分 4H 與其他多型，標記晶向及磊晶面~Distinguish 4H from other polytypes and label orientation/epitaxial face | 化學成分相同不代表晶體堆疊相同~Equal chemistry does not imply identical stacking | 只看 Si:C 比就確認多型~Identifying polytype from Si:C ratio alone
偏角與台階~Miscut and steps | 畫偏角表面台階，比較台階流與二維成核的假說~Sketch miscut steps and compare step-flow and island-nucleation hypotheses | 偏角和表面動力學共同影響成長~Miscut and surface kinetics jointly affect growth | 認為偏角是可忽略的幾何誤差~Treating miscut as irrelevant geometric error
差排傳承~Dislocation inheritance | 對基板與磊晶缺陷圖配準，區分繼承與新增缺陷~Register substrate/epilayer maps and separate inherited from new defects | 磊晶品質需要追溯基板缺陷~Epitaxial quality must be traced to substrate defects | 所有磊晶缺陷都由同一成長步驟新生~Assuming all epilayer defects are newly generated
基面差排~Basal-plane dislocations | 畫基面差排與可能堆疊錯擴展，連到双極注入的驗證~Draw basal dislocations and possible stacking-fault expansion with bipolar-injection checks | 某些結構缺陷可在載子注入後演化~Some structural defects evolve after carrier injection | 出廠缺陷圖能涵蓋所有操作後變化~Assuming as-grown maps capture every operational change
穿通差排~Threading dislocations | 區分刃型與螺型差排的幾何，列出成像交叉證據~Distinguish threading edge/screw geometry and list cross-imaging evidence | 不同差排不能只靠同一表面暗點分類~Different dislocations cannot be classified from one dark spot alone | 所有暗點都標為相同差排類型~Labeling all dark spots the same dislocation
表面台階聚集~Step bunching | 畫等距台階與聚集台階，計算相同掃描尺度的高度起伏~Compare regular/bunched steps at the same scan scale | 粗糙度需連同空間尺度解讀~Roughness must be interpreted with spatial scale | 不同掃描面積的 RMS 可直接排名~Ranking RMS values from different scan areas
厚度均勻度~Thickness uniformity | 建立徑向厚度圖並分開片內與片間偏差~Map radial thickness and separate within-wafer from wafer-to-wafer variation | 一個中心點無法代表全片漂移層~One center point cannot represent the whole drift layer | 中心厚度合格就代表全片耐壓一致~Inferring uniform blocking capability from center thickness
摻雜分布~Doping distribution | 對厚度和载子濃度建立雙圖，解釋阻斷與導通取捨~Map thickness/carrier concentration together and discuss blocking/conduction tradeoffs | 厚度與摻雜需共同設計~Thickness and doping need joint design | 只減少摻雜就無代價提升耐壓~Assuming reduced doping improves blocking without cost
表面污染~Surface contamination | 把粒子、殘碳及刮傷分開，選擇各自靈敏的檢查~Separate particles, carbon residue and scratches with suitable inspections | 清潔度與晶體缺陷是不同問題~Cleanliness and crystallographic defects are different issues | 晶體 X 光合格就證明表面潔淨~Inferring surface cleanliness from crystal X-ray quality
缺陷檢出率~Defect detectability | 將光致發光、表面影像與電性圖配對，記錄各法盲點~Correlate photoluminescence, surface images and electrical maps with blind spots | 不同方法對同一缺陷的可見性不同~Methods have different visibility for a given defect | 某法未看見就證明缺陷不存在~Taking non-detection by one method as absence
晶粒接受區~Die acceptance regions | 將缺陷座標覆到假設晶粒版圖，區分主動區與外圍~Overlay defects on hypothetical dies and separate active regions from periphery | 缺陷風險取決於位置與元件敏感度~Defect risk depends on location and device sensitivity | 每顆缺陷都以同一方式殺死所有晶粒~Assuming every defect kills every die equally
磊晶放行~Epitaxy release | 整合厚度、摻雜、缺陷、粗糙與基板追溯表~Combine thickness, doping, defects, roughness and substrate traceability | 磊晶放行須連到後續元件需求~Epitaxy release must connect to downstream device needs | 只選缺陷密度最低批次而忽略其他規格~Selecting minimum defect density while ignoring other requirements
''')
lessons('a082', '''
垂直元件路徑~Vertical device path | 畫源極、通道、漂移層與背面汲極，追蹤導通~Draw source, channel, drift region and backside drain and trace conduction | 垂直 MOSFET 的電阻由多區域組成~Vertical MOSFET resistance has multiple regional contributions | 把全部導通電阻都歸給通道~Attributing all on-resistance to the channel
阻斷設計~Blocking design | 比較假設漂移厚度與摻雜，分開耐壓及電阻趨勢~Compare hypothetical drift thickness/doping for blocking and resistance trends | 低電阻與高阻斷能力需要取捨~Low resistance and high blocking require tradeoffs | 任意提高摻雜卻保持同樣阻斷裕量~Increasing doping arbitrarily while retaining blocking margin
通道界面~Channel interface | 畫 SiC/氧化層捕捉態與通道載子，定義遷移率量測條件~Draw interface traps/carriers and define mobility-measurement conditions | 界面捕捉態可影響通道與閾值~Interface traps affect channel behavior and threshold | 只用體材料遷移率預測 MOS 通道~Predicting the MOS channel from bulk mobility alone
閘氧電場~Gate-oxide field | 對截面標出 SiC 和氧化層的電位降，比較角落場集中~Mark SiC/oxide voltage division and corner field crowding | 氧化層電場可靠度不同於漂移層耐壓~Oxide-field reliability differs from drift blocking | 元件耐壓高便代表閘極可承相同高壓~Assuming high drain rating implies equal gate-voltage tolerance
植入與活化~Implantation and activation | 畫假設植入輪廓與電性活化輪廓，區分總雜質與有效載子~Compare implanted and electrically active profiles | 植入劑量不直接等於有效摻雜~Implanted dose is not identical to active doping | 只看劑量就證明接觸區電阻~Inferring contact-region resistance from dose alone
平面與溝槽~Planar versus trench | 畫兩種通道及溝槽角落，列出面積、通道和場管理差別~Compare channels/corners with area and field-management tradeoffs | 溝槽面積利益需連同角落保護評估~Trench density benefits require corner-field assessment | 溝槽較密就必然全面優於平面~Assuming denser trenches are universally superior
接觸電阻~Contact resistance | 用假設 TLM 長度系列區分片電阻與接觸截距~Use hypothetical TLM spacings to separate sheet resistance and contact intercept | 二端電阻含接觸和通道貢獻~Two-terminal resistance includes contact and channel terms | 把二端總電阻直接當接觸電阻~Calling total two-terminal resistance contact resistance
邊緣終端~Edge termination | 畫主接面、終端環與表面，指出場線擴展~Draw main junction, termination rings and surface with field spreading | 晶片邊緣可能先限制阻斷能力~Die edges can limit blocking first | 只模擬無限大單元就保證整顆耐壓~Guaranteeing die blocking from an infinite-cell model
體二極體~Body diode | 畫反向導通的體二極體和受控通道路徑，分清載子~Distinguish reverse body-diode and gated-channel paths with carrier types | 不同反向導通路徑有不同損耗及退化~Reverse paths have different loss and degradation behavior | 所有反向電流都只經同一理想二極體~Sending all reverse current through one ideal diode
閾值穩定~Threshold stability | 比較正負閘應力後不同延遲的 Vth，保留恢復時間~Compare post-stress Vth at different delays and retain recovery time | 測量延遲可改變觀察到的捕捉效應~Measurement delay changes observed trapping effects | 忽略應力後延遲直接比較漂移~Comparing drift while ignoring post-stress delay
動態損耗~Dynamic losses | 以假設 V(t)I(t) 積分比較切換損耗與導通損耗~Integrate hypothetical V(t)I(t) and compare switching/conduction losses | 低 RDS(on) 不保證最低總損耗~Low on-resistance does not guarantee minimum total loss | 只按室溫導通電阻選最高頻方案~Selecting high-frequency devices by room-temperature resistance alone
晶片到模組~Die-to-module validation | 合併閘氧、終端、接觸與封裝熱阻的驗收證據~Combine gate, termination, contact and package thermal evidence | 封裝及驅動條件會改變元件實際應力~Package and drive conditions alter actual device stress | 裸晶測試合格就取消模組條件驗證~Skipping module-condition validation after a bare-die pass
''')
lessons('a083', '''
異質接面~Heterojunction | 畫 AlGaN/GaN 與能帶井，定位二維電子氣~Draw AlGaN/GaN and its band well and locate the 2DEG | 異質接面通道不同於矽 MOS 反轉層~A heterojunction channel differs from a silicon inversion layer | 把 2DEG 畫成整片均勻體摻雜~Drawing the 2DEG as uniform bulk doping
極化電荷~Polarization charge | 標出界面電荷及能帶彎曲，區分自由載子與固定電荷~Mark interface charge/band bending and separate fixed charge from mobile carriers | 極化電荷和載流子不是相同族群~Polarization charge and mobile carriers are different populations | 將固定極化電荷當成直接流動電流~Treating fixed polarization charge as current-carrying particles
常開與常關~Normally on/off | 比較零閘壓下通道是否耗盡的兩個能帶圖~Compare zero-gate-bias band diagrams with/devoid of a channel | 常關需要在零閘壓抑制通道~Normally-off operation requires channel suppression at zero gate bias | 只把驅動器關掉就把常開元件變成常關~Turning a normally-on device off merely by disabling its driver
p-GaN 與凹槽~p-GaN and recessed gates | 畫兩種閘極改造，分開材料移除和電性耗盡~Draw gate alternatives and distinguish removal from electrical depletion | 不同常關架構有不同閘極容限~Normally-off architectures have different gate tolerances | 對所有 GaN 共用同一閘極電壓規格~Using one gate-voltage limit for all GaN types
緩衝層~Buffer layer | 畫基板、緩衝及通道，列出漏電與應力路徑~Draw substrate, buffer and channel and mark leakage/stress paths | 緩衝層同時關係絕緣、缺陷與機械整合~Buffers affect isolation, defects and mechanical integration | 緩衝越厚就無条件改善所有電性~Assuming thicker buffers improve every electrical property
歐姆接觸~Ohmic contacts | 以假設 TLM 資料分離接觸電阻和接觸間通道電阻~Separate contact and channel resistance with hypothetical TLM data | 接觸電阻影響導通和 RF 性能~Contact resistance affects conduction and RF performance | 只提高通道遷移率就消除所有串聯損失~Eliminating all series loss by increasing mobility alone
場板~Field plates | 畫場板前後的場線和寄生電容，建立兩項取捨~Sketch field spreading and parasitic capacitance before/after a field plate | 場形塑可能同時增加寄生電容~Field shaping may also increase capacitance | 場板只提升耐壓而完全沒有動態代價~Assuming field plates add blocking with no dynamic cost
動態導通電阻~Dynamic on-resistance | 比較靜態與高壓休止後脈衝導通，記錄延遲與溫度~Compare static and post-blocking pulsed conduction with delay/temperature recorded | 捕捉與自熱可能共同影響動態電阻~Trapping and self-heating can jointly affect dynamic resistance | 只用直流電阻代表所有切換情境~Using DC resistance for every switching condition
反向導通~Reverse conduction | 畫橫向 HEMT 第三象限通道與矽體二極體差別~Compare lateral-HEMT third-quadrant channel and silicon body diode | 橫向 GaN HEMT 不靠同樣的矽體二極體結構~Lateral GaN HEMTs do not use the same silicon body-diode structure | 把矽二極體反向恢復模型原封套上~Copying a silicon diode recovery model unchanged
功率與 RF~Power versus RF | 對切換電源及放大器各列出損耗、線性、頻寬要求~List loss, linearity and bandwidth needs for switches versus amplifiers | 同一材料的最佳結構依用途而異~The best structure for one material depends on application | 一顆最高耐壓元件就必然有最佳 RF 增益~Assuming maximum voltage rating ensures best RF gain
熱路徑~Thermal paths | 畫通道熱點經基板、界面到散熱器的路徑~Trace channel hotspots through substrate/interfaces to a heat sink | 高臨界電場不代表容易散熱~High critical field does not imply easy heat removal | 只看材料能隙就決定可容許功率~Determining allowable power from bandgap alone
整合驗證~Integration verification | 合併閘極、緩衝、接觸、動態電阻與溫度的矩陣~Combine gate, buffer, contact, dynamic-resistance and thermal evidence | 低壓研究示範不可直接當高壓產品認證~Low-voltage demonstrations are not high-voltage qualification | 以單一研究最佳值代表完整量產規格~Treating one research record as a production specification
''')
lessons('a084', '''
直接能隙~Direct bandgap | 用能帶示意比較輻射和非輻射復合，標示能量出口~Compare radiative/nonradiative recombination and energy destinations | 電流不會全部轉換成出射光~Not all current becomes emitted light | 以注入電流直接等同光子流~Equating injected current with photon flux
基板失配~Substrate mismatch | 畫藍寶石與 GaN 晶格失配，加入緩衝層角色~Draw sapphire/GaN mismatch and the buffer role | 緩衝設計有助成長但不保證零缺陷~Buffers aid growth without guaranteeing defect-free material | 加緩衝層便完全消除失配~Assuming a buffer eliminates all mismatch
n 型與 p 型~n-type and p-type | 畫電子與電洞注入，區分 Mg 摻入與電性活化~Draw electron/hole injection and distinguish Mg incorporation from activation | 摻入受體不必然產生等量自由電洞~Acceptor incorporation need not produce equal free-hole density | 用 Mg 原子數直接當電洞濃度~Equating Mg atoms with free-hole concentration
量子井~Quantum wells | 畫 InGaN 井與 GaN 障壁，定位電子與電洞~Draw InGaN wells/GaN barriers and locate carriers | 量子井透過能帶侷限改變復合~Quantum wells modify recombination through confinement | 只把井當成沒有能带作用的色層~Treating wells as colored layers without band effects
組成與波長~Composition and wavelength | 比較假設銦組成及應變對能量的影響，避免只用單一因素~Compare hypothetical indium-content and strain effects on energy | 發光波長受組成、侷限與應變影響~Emission depends on composition, confinement and strain | 只看一個化學比例就保證精確波長~Guaranteeing exact wavelength from one composition ratio
極化內建場~Polarization field | 畫井中傾斜能帶與波函重疊，比較平帶參考~Draw tilted-well bands and wavefunction overlap versus a flat-band reference | 內建場可能分離電子與電洞~Internal fields can separate electrons and holes | 能障越高就必然有最大波函重疊~Assuming higher barriers always maximize overlap
多重量子井~Multiple quantum wells | 畫各井載子分配，檢查是否均勻及可能溢流~Sketch carrier distribution across wells and inspect nonuniformity/spillover | 多井不表示每井注入完全相等~Multiple wells do not imply equal injection per well | 將總電流平均分配便宣稱每井同效率~Assuming equal per-well efficiency by dividing current
電流擴展~Current spreading | 畫接觸附近與遠處注入路徑，預測亮度不均~Trace near/far-contact current paths and predict brightness variation | 片電阻與接觸配置影響均勻發光~Sheet resistance and contact layout affect uniform emission | 只看總光通量便證明整面發光均勻~Inferring uniform emission from total flux
光取出~Light extraction | 畫逃逸錐、全反射及粗化表面路徑~Draw escape cone, total reflection and textured-surface paths | 內部發光效率與外部取光效率不同~Internal efficiency differs from extraction efficiency | 量子井發光強就等同封裝出光強~Equating strong well emission with packaged light output
效率下降~Efficiency droop | 對假設電流密度畫效率曲線並提出多種候選機制~Plot hypothetical efficiency versus current density with competing mechanisms | 單條 droop 曲線不足以唯一辨識機制~One droop curve cannot uniquely identify a mechanism | 看到效率下降就指定唯一復合原因~Assigning a unique recombination cause from droop alone
熱與色偏~Heat and color shift | 比較短脈衝與連續驅動光譜，分離自熱與電流效應~Compare pulsed/continuous spectra to separate heating and current effects | 相同電流在不同熱條件可有不同光譜~Equal current under different thermal conditions can shift spectra | 把所有紅移都視為組成變化~Attributing all redshift to composition changes
磊晶驗收~Epitaxy acceptance | 結合 X 光、光致發光與電致發光，註明各法觀察深度~Combine X-ray, photoluminescence and electroluminescence with probe depth | 材料發光與注入發光提供不同資訊~Optical excitation and electrical injection provide different evidence | 單一 PL 峰就完整保證 LED 電性~Guaranteeing LED electrical behavior from one PL peak
''')
lessons('a085', '''
HBT 與 pHEMT~HBT versus pHEMT | 畫雙極載子注入與異質接面通道兩種截面~Draw bipolar injection and heterojunction-channel sections | 同為 GaAs RF 元件不代表相同控制機制~GaAs RF devices need not share a control mechanism | 用同一閘極模型描述 HBT 基極~Describing an HBT base with an unchanged gate model
異質磊晶~Heteroepitaxy | 畫晶格匹配與應變層，標出可能差排來源~Draw matched/strained layers and possible dislocation origins | 異質材料設計需兼顧能帶及晶格~Heterostructures need band and lattice design together | 只選最高遷移率材料忽略晶格~Choosing mobility while ignoring lattice compatibility
通道片電荷~Channel sheet charge | 分開片密度、遷移率與片電阻，做假設單位換算~Separate sheet density, mobility and resistance with unit checks | 片密度與體密度單位不同~Sheet and volume density have different units | 把 cm^-2 直接當成 cm^-3~Treating cm^-2 as cm^-3
HBT 基極~HBT base | 畫射極、薄基極與集極，連結渡越時間和基極電阻~Draw emitter, thin base and collector and relate transit time/base resistance | 薄基極收益需連同電阻及耐壓評估~A thin base must be assessed with resistance and blocking | 基極越薄所有性能都單調改善~Assuming every metric improves with a thinner base
閘長與寄生~Gate length and parasitics | 畫內在閘極及外接電阻電容，分開內外增益限制~Separate intrinsic gate and extrinsic resistance/capacitance limits | 短閘不自動消除封裝與接觸寄生~Short gates do not eliminate package/contact parasitics | 只用閘長倒數預測模組頻寬~Predicting module bandwidth solely from inverse gate length
接觸測試~Contact testing | 用假設 TLM 和 Kelvin 接點比較接觸与線路貢獻~Compare contact/line contributions with hypothetical TLM and Kelvin structures | 量測連接方式會影響所見電阻~Connection topology affects measured resistance | 用二線電阻代表去嵌入後接觸~Calling two-wire resistance a de-embedded contact result
隔離與漏電~Isolation and leakage | 畫元件間半絕緣基板及表面路徑，列出關斷量測~Draw substrate/surface isolation paths and specify off-state tests | 半絕緣基板不保證表面無漏電~A semi-insulating substrate does not guarantee no surface leakage | 只看基板名稱便取消隔離測試~Skipping isolation tests because of the substrate label
S 參數~S-parameters | 標示兩埠參考面及校正件，區分晶片與探針線纜響應~Mark two-port reference planes/calibration standards and separate fixture response | S 參數必須附頻率、偏壓和參考阻抗~S-parameters require frequency, bias and reference impedance | 未校正線纜便把總量測當裸晶~Treating uncalibrated cable response as bare-die data
去嵌入~De-embedding | 畫 open/short dummy 結構並列明它們移除的寄生~Draw open/short dummies and list removed parasitics | 不匹配的 dummy 可引入新誤差~Mismatched dummy structures can introduce errors | 任意空白焊墊都能精確去除全部寄生~Assuming any empty pad removes every parasitic exactly
線性與壓縮~Linearity and compression | 比較小訊號增益与輸出壓縮曲線，區分輸入功率範圍~Compare small-signal gain and compression over input power | 小訊號指標不能完整預測大訊號性能~Small-signal metrics do not fully predict large-signal performance | 高小訊號增益就保證高功率線性~Inferring high-power linearity from high small-signal gain
自熱~Self-heating | 比較相同峰值但不同脈寬的假設 I-V，檢查熱時間效應~Compare hypothetical I-V at equal peaks and different pulse widths | RF 元件熱狀態會改變偏壓及增益~Thermal state affects RF bias and gain | 全部脈衝差異都歸為載子遷移率~Attributing every pulse difference to mobility
技術選擇~Technology selection | 對低雜訊接收與功率放大各建立 HBT/pHEMT 比較矩陣~Compare HBT/pHEMT for low-noise reception and power amplification | 最佳製程取決於系統角色~The preferred process depends on system role | 同一材料平台在所有 RF 功能都最佳~Assuming one platform is best for every RF function
''')
lessons('a086', '''
材料潛力與實現~Material potential versus realization | 將理想材料優值與實測元件指標分為兩張表~Separate ideal material figures of merit from measured device metrics | 理想優值不等於實際元件效率~An ideal figure of merit is not actual efficiency | 把理論材料排名當成產品能效排名~Ranking product efficiency by ideal materials alone
晶相與方向~Phase and orientation | 畫 β-Ga2O3 晶向与測試方向，註明各向異性~Draw beta-Ga2O3 orientation and measurement directions with anisotropy | 不同晶向的性質可能不同~Properties can differ with crystallographic direction | 以一個方向的數值代表所有方向~Using one directional value for every orientation
塊材與磊晶~Bulk and epitaxy | 區分熔融成長基板與後續主動磊晶層~Separate melt-grown substrate from active epilayer | 基板可成長不代表元件層已達要求~Growable substrates do not establish device-layer quality | 大基板存在就等於所有元件整合完成~Equating a large substrate with complete device integration
摻雜與補償~Doping and compensation | 畫施體、深受體及自由載子，區分補償和電洞導電~Draw donors, deep acceptors and carriers and distinguish compensation from hole conduction | 補償區不自動等於成熟 p 型導電層~A compensated region is not automatically a mature p-conducting layer | 植入受體就必然得到高遷移率電洞~Assuming acceptor implantation guarantees mobile holes
橫向與垂直~Lateral versus vertical | 畫兩種電流路徑和散熱出口，比較面積利用~Draw current/heat paths for both geometries and compare area use | 幾何改變同時影響電場及熱路徑~Geometry changes both field and heat paths | 垂直結構只改電流方向不影響其他條件~Assuming vertical geometry changes only current direction
接觸介面~Contact interface | 比較接觸限制和通道限制的假設 I-V 並設計 TLM 對照~Compare contact/channel-limited I-V with a TLM control | 高通道電流可能仍受接觸限制~Channel current can still be contact-limited | 所有非線性都歸因於晶體本體~Attributing all nonlinearity to bulk crystal
閘極介電~Gate dielectric | 畫氧化物半導體與閘介電層的能帶邊界~Draw band boundaries between semiconductor and gate dielectric | 寬能隙半導體仍需驗證閘介面漏電~Wide bandgap does not eliminate gate-interface leakage checks | 材料本身是氧化物便不需要閘絕緣~Assuming an oxide semiconductor needs no gate insulator
電場終端~Field termination | 比較裸邊緣和場形塑的等位線示意~Compare equipotentials at bare and field-managed edges | 局部場峰值可先限制實際耐壓~Local field peaks can limit practical blocking first | 直接用材料臨界場乘全長保證耐壓~Guaranteeing blocking from critical field times total length
自熱侷限~Self-heating constraint | 建立假設熱阻網路並分開導通損耗和熱導能力~Build a hypothetical thermal network separating electrical loss and conduction | 低電性損失不保證低接面溫度~Low electrical loss does not guarantee low junction temperature | 能隙大便代表熱導率一定高~Assuming wide bandgap implies high thermal conductivity
異質散熱~Heterogeneous cooling | 畫與高熱導載板接合後的界面熱阻~Draw bonding to a thermally conductive carrier with interfacial resistance | 新載板的收益可能受介面熱阻限制~Carrier benefits may be interface-limited | 忽略接合界面就使用載板本體熱導率~Using bulk carrier conductivity while ignoring the bond
陷阱暫態~Trap transients | 比較應力後不同延遲的電流恢復，和純熱恢復作對照~Compare delay-dependent current recovery against thermal recovery | 捕捉與熱效應需不同時間與溫度對照~Trapping and heating require timing/temperature controls | 一條恢復曲線足以唯一判斷缺陷~Identifying a unique defect from one recovery curve
研究成熟度~Research maturity | 將展示、重複樣本、晶圓分布和產品認證分級~Separate demonstrations, replicates, wafer distributions and qualification | 單顆研究元件不足以證明量產成熟~One research device does not establish manufacturing maturity | 宣布新結構就等於市場產品已可靠~Equating a new structure announcement with reliable products
''')
lessons('a087', '''
單層與晶粒~Monolayer and grains | 畫單層厚度、晶粒邊界與覆蓋率，分開三種品質指標~Separate monolayer thickness, grain boundaries and coverage in a sketch | 連續覆蓋不保證單晶或無缺陷~Continuous coverage does not imply single crystal or no defects | 全片覆蓋便視為所有載子路徑相同~Treating full coverage as identical transport everywhere
成長與轉移~Growth and transfer | 比較直接成長及外基板成長後轉移的熱流程~Compare thermal flows for direct growth and growth followed by transfer | 生長最佳條件未必符合目標晶片熱預算~Best growth conditions may violate target-chip thermal budgets | 可在基板成長就能原樣搬到完成晶片~Moving a growth process unchanged to completed chips
暫時載板~Temporary carrier | 畫支撐、接合及釋離界面，追蹤單層受力~Draw support, bonding and release interfaces and trace monolayer loading | 轉移是界面與機械邊界的工程~Transfer is interface and mechanical-boundary engineering | 原子薄就必然沒有機械破損~Assuming atomic thinness prevents mechanical damage
皺褶與裂縫~Wrinkles and cracks | 將兩種缺陷覆到假設通道圖，分別預測應變及斷路~Overlay wrinkles/cracks on channels and distinguish strain from breaks | 不同形貌缺陷產生不同電性後果~Different morphology defects have different electrical effects | 所有暗線都用同一電阻修正描述~Using one resistance correction for every dark line
轉移殘留~Transfer residue | 比較表面形貌、化學訊號及電性漂移，設置空白載板~Compare morphology, chemistry and electrical drift with carrier blanks | 光學看似潔淨不保證無有機殘留~Optical cleanliness does not prove absence of organic residue | 只看顯微照片就核准原子級界面~Accepting atomic interfaces from optical images alone
接觸障壁~Contact barrier | 畫金屬與 2D 材料能帶，區分障壁高度及有效注入長度~Draw metal/2D bands and distinguish barrier height from injection length | 接觸性能由界面與幾何共同決定~Contacts depend on interfaces and geometry together | 只以金屬功函數預測全部接觸電阻~Predicting all contact resistance from work function
接觸抽取~Contact extraction | 用假設不同通道長度 TLM 比較接觸截距與片電阻~Use hypothetical channel-length TLM to separate intercept and sheet resistance | 長度系列需要可比通道與閘偏壓~Length-series extraction needs comparable channels and gate bias | 混合不同載子密度樣本直接回歸~Regressing samples with mixed carrier densities
介電成核~Dielectric nucleation | 畫惰性基面與種子層成核，指出新增介面的代價~Sketch nucleation on a passivated basal plane and seed layer with interface costs | 促進沉積也可能增加 EOT 或缺陷~Promoting deposition can add EOT or defects | ALD 可不經驗證在所有惰性表面均勻成核~Assuming ALD nucleates uniformly on every inert surface
摻雜方法~Doping methods | 比較靜電、表面電荷轉移及取代摻雜的可逆性~Compare reversibility of electrostatic, surface-transfer and substitutional doping | 薄層對局部損傷特別敏感~Atomically thin layers are sensitive to local damage | 直接沿用塊材離子植入而無損傷評估~Copying bulk implantation without damage assessment
n/p 配對~n/p pairing | 為 MoS2 與 WSe2 畫互補元件需求，分開材料和接觸問題~Map complementary-device needs for MoS2/WSe2 and separate material/contact issues | 一個優秀 nFET 不代表完整 CMOS 已實現~An excellent nFET does not establish complete CMOS | n 型成功即可宣稱 p 型同樣成熟~Inferring p-type maturity from n-type success
穩定性~Stability | 比較不同環境及閘應力後遲滯，保留掃描方向和速度~Compare environment/gate-stress hysteresis with sweep direction and rate | 遲滯可能混合介面捕捉與吸附效應~Hysteresis can mix trapping and adsorption | 任意掃描所得遷移率都可直接比較~Comparing mobility from arbitrary sweeps
晶圓可製造性~Wafer manufacturability | 將形貌良率、元件電性良率與長期穩定分開記錄~Record morphology yield, electrical yield and long-term stability separately | 高覆蓋率不等於高功能良率~High coverage yield is not high functional yield | 用形貌成功百分比代表全部電路良率~Using morphology success as complete circuit yield
''')
lessons('a088', '''
質量彈簧~Mass and spring | 用假設 m、k 畫 F=ma 與 x=ma/k 靜態關係~Use hypothetical mass/stiffness to draw F=ma and x=ma/k | 靜態近似需要低於機械共振的條件~Static approximation needs operation below resonance | 把靜態位移式套到所有振動頻率~Applying static displacement at every frequency
差動梳齒~Differential combs | 畫正反位移下兩側電容變化與差動讀出~Draw opposite capacitance changes and differential readout | 差動訊號可分離部分共模變化~Differential signals reject some common-mode changes | 差動架構自動消除全部偏差~Assuming differential geometry removes every bias
共振與阻尼~Resonance and damping | 畫兩個阻尼值的頻率響應並標示量測頻寬~Plot two damping responses and mark usable bandwidth | 高 Q 值不必然適合寬頻加速度測量~High Q is not always suitable for broadband acceleration | Q 越高所有慣性感測用途都越好~Assuming higher Q benefits every inertial application
陀螺耦合~Gyroscope coupling | 畫驅動軸、角速度與科氏感測軸的方向~Draw drive, rotation and Coriolis-sensing directions | 陀螺和加速度計使用不同動態資訊~Gyroscopes and accelerometers use different dynamics | 把静止重力響應直接當角速度~Treating static gravity response as angular rate
深矽輪廓~Deep-silicon profile | 畫彈簧側壁斜度與刻蚀 scallop，預測有效剛性變化~Draw spring taper/scallops and predict effective stiffness changes | 微小幾何偏差可能顯著改變彈簧剛性~Small geometry errors can strongly alter spring stiffness | 只量上表面線寬就完整知道彈簧截面~Inferring the full spring section from top width
犧牲層釋放~Sacrificial release | 畫釋放孔、移除路徑及保留錨點~Draw release openings, removal paths and retained anchors | 釋放須去除犧牲層但保留機械連接~Release removes sacrificial material while retaining anchors | 釋放越多就一定活動越自由且更可靠~Assuming more removal always improves reliable motion
沾黏~Stiction | 畫乾燥彎月面與彈簧回復力方向，區分接觸與永久黏住~Draw meniscus/restoring forces and distinguish contact from lasting adhesion | 表面力可能勝過微結構回復力~Surface forces can exceed microstructure restoring force | 元件重量很小就不可能被表面力拉住~Assuming low weight prevents surface-force sticking
封裝氣壓~Package pressure | 比較假設腔壓對阻尼與響應時間的影響~Compare cavity pressure effects on damping and response time | 封裝氣氛是機械系統邊界條件~Package atmosphere is a mechanical boundary condition | 密封只防灰塵而不影響動態~Treating sealing only as dust protection
殘留應力~Residual stress | 畫薄膜應力造成的翹曲与間隙改變~Draw film-stress curvature and gap changes | 初始間隙改變會影響電容與運動範圍~Initial gap changes affect capacitance and travel | 平均膜厚合格便證明機械零偏合格~Inferring mechanical zero offset from average film thickness
交軸響應~Cross-axis response | 設計三方向輸入矩陣並抽取靈敏度矩陣~Design three-axis inputs and extract a sensitivity matrix | 軸向耦合需矩陣校正而非單一比例~Cross-axis coupling needs a matrix, not one scale factor | 只校正主軸就保證三軸正交~Assuming main-axis calibration guarantees orthogonality
自我測試~Self-test | 畫靜電測試力和真實慣性力路徑，列出可及不可驗證項~Compare electrostatic test and inertial-force paths and their coverage | 自我測試未必涵蓋完整外部機械路徑~Self-test may not cover the full external mechanical path | 通過自測就代表所有封裝與安裝都正確~Assuming self-test validates all mounting/package effects
溫漂校正~Temperature calibration | 建立零偏和比例因子的溫度圖，保留加熱冷卻方向~Map offset/scale versus temperature with heating/cooling direction | 零偏溫漂與比例溫漂是不同校正項~Offset drift and scale drift are different corrections | 一個零點補償足以修正所有溫度誤差~Using one offset correction for all thermal error
''')
lessons('a089', '''
壓力定義~Pressure definition | 畫絕對、表壓與差壓的兩側邊界~Draw both sides for absolute, gauge and differential pressure | 壓力讀值必須指定參考側~Pressure readings require a reference side | 沒有參考側也可直接比較所有壓力~Comparing all pressures without reference definitions
膜片彎曲~Diaphragm bending | 畫固定邊緣膜片的變形與應力分布~Draw deflection/stress in a clamped diaphragm | 最大位移位置與最大應力位置未必相同~Maximum displacement and stress need not coincide | 把中心位移直接等同邊緣應力~Equating center displacement with edge stress
厚度靈敏度~Thickness sensitivity | 比較两個假設膜厚的小變形撓曲，標明近似限制~Compare small-deflection models for two thicknesses and state limits | 膜厚對剛性有強烈非線性影響~Thickness has a strong nonlinear stiffness effect | 膜厚減半只令變形增加一半~Assuming a linear half-thickness response
壓阻讀出~Piezoresistive readout | 畫四電阻電橋與受拉受壓位置，確認輸出符號~Draw a four-resistor bridge with tensile/compressive sites and output sign | 電橋位置與晶向影響靈敏度~Bridge placement and crystal orientation affect sensitivity | 任意放四個相同電阻都得到相同訊號~Assuming any four resistor placements give equal signal
電容讀出~Capacitive readout | 畫膜片和固定電極，分開位移及邊緣寄生電容~Draw moving/fixed electrodes and separate displacement from parasitics | 小間隙提高靈敏度但限制行程~Small gaps improve sensitivity but limit travel | 無限縮小間隙且完全不改過壓風險~Shrinking gaps indefinitely with no overload penalty
背腔製作~Back-cavity formation | 在正背對位圖追蹤腔體、膜片與停止層~Trace cavity, diaphragm and stop layer in front/back views | 殘餘膜厚需要可量測的停止與均勻度~Residual thickness requires controlled stopping and uniformity | 蝕刻時間相同便保證所有膜片同厚~Assuming equal etch time guarantees equal diaphragms
參考腔~Reference cavity | 畫真空參考腔、漏氣與殘氣，預測零點變化~Draw vacuum reference, leak and residual gas and predict offset changes | 密封參考壓力可能隨時間與溫度變動~Sealed reference pressure can change with time/temperature | 密封後參考壓力永遠固定不需驗證~Assuming sealed reference remains constant forever
封裝應力~Package stress | 畫黏著與基板熱膨脹拉扯膜片的路徑~Trace adhesive/substrate thermal stress reaching the diaphragm | 外部封裝應力可模仿壓力訊號~Package stress can mimic pressure | 裸晶零偏合格便保證封裝零偏~Inferring packaged offset from bare-die offset
保護介質~Protective media | 比較凝膠、氣孔與壓力傳遞路径，列出延遲和相容性~Compare gel, vent and pressure paths with delay/compatibility | 保護介質也改變壓力響應動態~Protection media alter pressure-response dynamics | 防水只增加保護而完全不影響量測~Assuming waterproofing has no measurement effect
過壓與量程~Overpressure and range | 分開額定量程、可恢復過壓與破裂壓力的假設圖~Separate rated, recoverable overload and burst ranges | 結構不破裂不等於讀值仍精確~Survival does not imply accurate measurement | 破裂壓力以内都當成線性量測範圍~Treating all sub-burst pressure as a linear range
溫度補償~Temperature compensation | 用假設壓力溫度網格分離零點及靈敏度漂移~Separate offset and sensitivity drift on a pressure-temperature grid | 單一温度校正不足以涵蓋交互作用~Single-temperature calibration misses interactions | 用一條溫度直線取代整個壓力範圍驗證~Replacing range validation with one temperature line
氣壓與高度~Pressure and altitude | 將同一壓力用兩種參考天氣條件換算高度並比較~Convert equal pressure under two reference-weather assumptions | 氣壓高度不是無条件的幾何高度~Barometric altitude is not unconditional geometric altitude | 感測器精準便代表不需天氣參考~Assuming sensor precision removes weather-reference needs
''')
lessons('a090', '''
像素開關~Pixel switching | 畫 TFT、儲存電容和顯示負載，追蹤一列更新~Draw TFT, storage capacitor and display load and trace row updating | 背板控制與發光材料是不同功能~Backplane control and light emission are different functions | 把 TFT 通道直接當成發光層~Treating the TFT channel as the emitting layer
材料選擇~Channel selection | 比較 a-Si、LTPS、IGZO 的均勻度、遷移率與製程要求~Compare uniformity, mobility and process needs for a-Si/LTPS/IGZO | 高遷移率只是背板需求之一~Mobility is only one backplane requirement | 只按最高遷移率決定所有顯示用途~Choosing all display uses by maximum mobility
玻璃熱預算~Glass thermal budget | 把玻璃、薄膜與後續封裝的可接受熱條件列成表~List compatible thermal conditions for glass, films and later integration | 基板限制會改變可用製程~Substrate constraints change feasible processing | 套用矽晶圓高溫流程而不查玻璃~Applying silicon-wafer heating without checking glass
IGZO 化學~IGZO chemistry | 畫氧相關缺陷和載流子，分開導通與關斷需求~Draw oxygen-related defects/carriers and separate on/off needs | 載子過多可能提高漏電而非全面改善~Excess carriers can increase leakage rather than improve everything | 通道越導電就代表 TFT 越好~Assuming more conductive channels always make better TFTs
閘介面~Gate interface | 畫閘介電層陷阱及通道，預測次臨界斜率與遲滯~Draw dielectric traps/channel and predict subthreshold/hysteresis effects | 介面品質影響開關陡峭度與穩定~Interface quality affects switching and stability | 只測膜厚就證明閘介面品質~Proving gate-interface quality from thickness alone
氫與鈍化~Hydrogen and passivation | 比較有無阻隔層的氫擴散路徑與電性漂移~Compare hydrogen paths and drift with/without barriers | 保護薄膜的化學影響需和阻隔功能一起評估~Passivation chemistry must be assessed with barrier function | 任何含氫鈍化都無条件有益~Assuming hydrogen-containing passivation is always beneficial
接觸与通道~Contacts and channel | 以不同長度 TFT 假設 I-V 分離接觸限制~Use hypothetical TFT length-series I-V to isolate contacts | 低通道電阻仍可能被接觸主導~Low channel resistance can remain contact-limited | 全部低電流都歸為遷移率差~Attributing all low current to poor mobility
大面積均勻~Large-area uniformity | 畫面板中心到邊緣的膜厚及 Vth 地圖~Map thickness and threshold from panel center to edge | 晶圓級均勻度不自動等於玻璃大面積均勻~Wafer uniformity does not imply panel-scale uniformity | 只測小試片便核准整張玻璃~Qualifying a whole panel from a small coupon
保持與漏電~Hold and leakage | 用假設電容和漏電估算一幀內的像素電壓下降~Estimate pixel voltage loss over a frame from hypothetical capacitance/leakage | 低刷新率會放大保持需求~Low refresh rates increase hold requirements | 刷新變慢便可忽略關斷漏電~Ignoring off leakage at slower refresh
偏壓照光應力~Bias-illumination stress | 設計暗處偏壓、照光無偏壓與照光偏壓三個對照~Design dark-bias, light-only and light-bias controls | 光與偏壓可能存在交互效應~Illumination and bias can interact | 單獨通過兩項測試即保證同時通過~Assuming separate passes guarantee combined-stress success
驅動補償~Drive compensation | 畫感測 Vth 的像素電路與補償後殘差~Draw a threshold-sensing pixel circuit and residual error | 補償需付出電路、時間或面積成本~Compensation costs circuitry, time or area | 軟體補償可完全消除任何硬體失效~Assuming software compensation removes every hardware failure
面板驗收~Panel acceptance | 結合電性地圖、亮度不均、死點及長期漂移~Combine electrical maps, luminance nonuniformity, dead pixels and aging | 面板品質需要元件和光學共同驗證~Panel quality requires device and optical evidence | 只看最亮區域照片代表整板品質~Representing panel quality by its brightest photograph
''')
lessons('a091', '''
灰階到邊緣~Grayscale to edge | 畫跨越兩邊的線掃描灰階，標出候選邊緣演算法~Draw a line-scan grayscale profile and mark candidate edge algorithms | 影像邊緣位置取決於訊號及定義~Image-edge position depends on signal and definition | 最亮像素永遠就是實體邊界~Assuming the brightest pixel is always the physical edge
像素校正~Pixel calibration | 以假設標準節距換算 nm/pixel 並標示校正不確定度~Calibrate nm/pixel with a hypothetical pitch standard and uncertainty | 放大影像不會自動提高尺度準確度~Magnification does not automatically improve scale accuracy | 將放大倍率當成可追溯校正~Treating magnification as traceable calibration
低能电子~Low-energy electrons | 比較兩入射能量的表面敏感度、訊號与損傷取捨~Compare surface sensitivity, signal and damage at two landing energies | 較低能量可減少部分損傷但非完全無影響~Lower energy reduces some damage, not all interaction | 低電壓影像一律沒有量測擾動~Assuming low-voltage images never perturb samples
充電~Charging | 畫連續掃描下位置偏移及亮度改變，加入導電參考~Draw repeated-scan shifts/intensity changes with a conductive reference | 絕緣表面充電會改變電子軌跡~Insulator charging changes electron trajectories | 所有影像漂移都當成真實線寬變化~Treating all image drift as true CD change
電子劑量~Electron dose | 比較先後掃描順序的假設光阻 CD，估算累積劑量~Compare resist CD versus scan order and estimate accumulated dose | 重複量測本身可能改變光阻~Repeated measurement can alter resist | 重複次數越多就無代價接近真值~Assuming unlimited repeats converge without altering the sample
焦點與像散~Focus and astigmatism | 比較水平和垂直線的邊緣寬度，分辨像散與真實形貌~Compare horizontal/vertical edge widths to separate astigmatism from geometry | 儀器方向性模糊可能模仿圖形差異~Directional blur can mimic geometry differences | 單方向銳利即可證明所有方向量測可靠~Accepting all directions from one sharp orientation
上中下 CD~Top/middle/bottom CD | 在梯形截面標出三種寬度並對應頂視可觀察量~Mark three widths on a trapezoid and relate them to top-view observables | 頂視輪廓未必唯一決定整個截面~Top-view profiles need not uniquely determine a section | 將頂視 CD 直接當成底部 CD~Calling top-view CD the bottom CD
線邊粗糙~Line-edge roughness | 對假設邊緣座標去趨勢，分開兩邊粗糙和線寬粗糙~Detrend edge coordinates and separate each edge from width roughness | 左右邊相關性影響線寬粗糙~Edge correlation affects line-width roughness | 將單邊粗糙度直接乘二當 LWR~Doubling one edge roughness as LWR
抽樣位置~Sampling sites | 在晶圓圖規劃中心、邊緣和圖形密度抽樣~Plan center, edge and density-based wafer sampling | 抽樣位置會影響所見分布~Sampling locations affect observed distributions | 只測容易找到的圖形代表整片~Representing a wafer by convenient patterns only
工具匹配~Tool matching | 對同一參考片做兩台儀器配對量測，分開偏差与散布~Pair two tools on one reference wafer and separate bias/spread | 重複性良好不代表兩台無系統偏差~Good repeatability does not imply tool agreement | 散布小就直接宣稱準確~Equating small spread with accuracy
模型式量測~Model-based measurement | 比較簡單閾值及電子訊號模型的邊緣推定~Compare threshold and electron-signal-model edge inference | 加入模型可用資訊也引入模型假設~Models add information and assumptions together | 複雜模型輸出就一定比原圖真實~Assuming complex model output is automatically truer
尺寸報告~Dimension report | 提交尺度、邊緣定義、劑量、樣本數和不確定度表~Report scale, edge definition, dose, sample count and uncertainty | 可比較的 CD 需要完整量測條件~Comparable CDs require measurement conditions | 只報一個奈米數而省略量測定義~Reporting one nanometer number without its definition
''')
lessons('a092', '''
週期標靶~Periodic targets | 畫光柵節距、線寬、高度与側壁角的參數圖~Parameterize grating pitch, width, height and sidewall angle | 散射反演需要明確幾何參數化~Scatter inversion needs explicit geometry parameterization | 不定義形狀便宣稱光譜能直接讀出線寬~Reading CD directly from spectra without geometry assumptions
前向與反向~Forward and inverse | 分開幾何生成光譜與光譜推回幾何兩個流程~Separate geometry-to-spectrum and spectrum-to-geometry workflows | 易算前向不代表反問題唯一~A tractable forward problem need not have a unique inverse | 一條模擬曲線就證明幾何唯一~Inferring unique geometry from one simulated curve
RCWA 假設~RCWA assumptions | 畫無限週期模型和有限照明區，標出邊界差別~Draw infinite-periodic and finite-illumination boundaries | 週期求解器需要評估有限標靶效應~Periodic solvers need finite-target assessment | 無限週期解可無條件套用孤立線~Applying infinite-periodic solutions to isolated lines without checks
光學常數~Optical constants | 在同一幾何改變假設 n、k，觀察光譜變化~Perturb hypothetical n and k at fixed geometry and compare spectra | 材料常數誤差可能被誤擬合為幾何改變~Optical-constant error can mimic geometry change | 把所有光譜差異都解成尺寸偏差~Interpreting every spectral difference as geometry error
偏振和角度~Polarization and angle | 比較兩偏振和兩角度資料對側壁及高度的敏感度~Compare two polarizations/angles for sidewall and height sensitivity | 多條件量測可增加可識別資訊~Multiple conditions can improve identifiability | 增加同角度重複數就等於增加新物理資訊~Equating repeated same-angle scans with new physical information
參數相關~Parameter correlation | 用假設等誤差橢圓表示線寬和高度的互補變化~Draw a hypothetical equal-error ellipse for width/height tradeoff | 低殘差可同時對應多組參數~Low residuals can correspond to multiple parameter sets | 最佳擬合一組就證明其餘都不可能~Treating one optimum as proof all alternatives are impossible
靈敏度矩陣~Sensitivity matrix | 分別小幅擾動每參數，建立各波長訊號變化矩陣~Perturb each parameter and tabulate wavelength responses | 類似靈敏度向量造成參數難分辨~Similar sensitivity vectors make parameters hard to separate | 對任何參數都保留任意多小數~Reporting arbitrary precision for every parameter
粗糙度~Roughness | 比較理想週期與帶隨機邊緣的假設圖形~Compare ideal periodic patterns with random edges | 隨機粗糙會破壞簡單週期模型~Random roughness violates simple periodic models | 把隨機粗糙完全當作平均 CD 位移~Treating roughness solely as mean CD shift
模型選擇~Model selection | 比較單梯形和雙層模型，使用保留波段判斷泛化~Compare single-trapezoid/two-layer models using held-out spectra | 更多參數可降低訓練殘差而不提高真實性~More parameters can lower fitted error without increasing validity | 永遠選參數最多的最低殘差模型~Always selecting the most complex lowest-error model
交叉量測~Cross-metrology | 將光學平均剖面與局部 SEM/TEM 對照，先對齊量測定義~Compare averaged optical profiles with local microscopy after matching definitions | 不同探針看見不同空間平均~Different probes measure different spatial averages | 不同方法數字不等就直接判定某法錯誤~Declaring one method wrong whenever values differ
不確定度~Uncertainty | 分開重複雜訊、角度校正和材料模型三項誤差~Separate repeat noise, angle calibration and material-model uncertainty | 重複性只涵蓋總不確定度的一部分~Repeatability covers only part of total uncertainty | 用重複標準差代替全部準確度~Using repeat standard deviation as total accuracy
製程回授~Process feedback | 將可識別的尺寸與模糊參數分開，只回授有證據的變因~Separate identifiable and ambiguous parameters and feed back supported variables | 控制器不應追逐不可識別參數~Controllers should not chase unidentifiable parameters | 把所有擬合輸出直接當可靠控制量~Treating every fit output as a reliable control variable
''')
lessons('a093', '''
p/s 偏振~p/s polarization | 定義入射平面並標出 p 與 s 場方向~Define the incidence plane and mark p/s fields | 偏振定義需相對於入射平面~Polarization definitions are relative to incidence plane | 把水平與垂直永遠當 p 和 s~Treating horizontal/vertical as universally p/s
Psi 與 Delta~Psi and Delta | 以 rho=rp/rs=tan(Psi)exp(iDelta) 分開振幅比與相位~Separate amplitude ratio/phase using rho=rp/rs=tan(Psi)exp(iDelta) | 橢偏量測是相對偏振響應~Ellipsometry measures relative polarization response | 把 Psi 直接當反射率~Calling Psi the reflectance
薄膜干涉~Thin-film interference | 畫上表面反射與膜內往返路徑，標出相位差~Draw surface/interior paths and phase differences | 光程同時包含厚度及折射率~Optical path includes thickness and refractive index | 只用幾何厚度而忽略 n~Ignoring refractive index in optical path
堆疊模型~Stack model | 建立空氣、粗糙層、薄膜及基板的層序~Build air, roughness, film and substrate ordering | 漏掉介面層會改變抽取的其他參數~Omitted interface layers bias other extracted parameters | 最低殘差就證明沒有漏層~Treating low residual as proof no layer is omitted
厚度與 n~Thickness-index coupling | 畫兩組 n、t 近似相同光程，規劃第二角度量測~Draw two n/t pairs with similar path length and plan another angle | 相同光程可能產生參數退化~Similar path lengths can produce parameter degeneracy | 一個波長便任意解出 n、k 和厚度~Solving arbitrary n, k and thickness from one wavelength
吸收限制~Absorption limits | 比較透明與強吸收薄膜的返回光路~Compare return paths in transparent/absorbing films | 太深處的介面在強吸收下可能不可見~Deep interfaces may be invisible under strong absorption | 增厚金屬仍可無限精確測其底界面~Assuming unlimited bottom-interface access through thick metal
色散模型~Dispersion model | 對透明區使用假設 Cauchy 曲線，標記不適用的吸收區~Use a hypothetical Cauchy curve in transparency and mark absorbing regions | 透明模型不能無條件延伸到吸收能帶~Transparent models cannot be extended blindly into absorption | 同一透明模型適用所有波長~Applying one transparency model at every wavelength
多角度資料~Multi-angle data | 比較同片兩角度共同擬合和分別擬合的參數~Compare joint and separate fits at two angles | 共用物理參數可揭露角度間不一致~Shared parameters reveal cross-angle inconsistencies | 各角度隨意改厚度以取得好擬合~Changing thickness per angle solely to fit well
背面反射~Backside reflection | 畫透明基板背面光路，比較遮背與未遮背訊號~Trace backside reflection and compare suppressed/unsuppressed data | 基板背反射可污染前表面模型~Backside reflection can contaminate front-surface modeling | 所有多重反射都一定來自目標薄膜~Attributing every extra reflection to the target film
去偏振~Depolarization | 比較均勻光斑與跨越兩種厚度的光斑~Compare a uniform spot with one spanning two thicknesses | 光斑內不均可能造成去偏振~Within-spot nonuniformity can cause depolarization | 把去偏振完全當成儀器隨機雜訊~Treating all depolarization as random instrument noise
標準與漂移~Standards and drift | 用假設穩定參考片追蹤每日 Psi/Delta 殘差~Track daily Psi/Delta residuals on a stable reference | 校驗片能監控漂移但仍需其自身穩定性~Check standards monitor drift but must themselves be stable | 參考片數值變動一定只是儀器錯誤~Assuming every reference change is instrument error
報告與限制~Report and limits | 同時提交模型層序、波段、角度、相關係數和厚度區間~Report layer model, spectrum, angles, correlations and thickness interval | 厚度結果是條件化的模型推論~Thickness is a model-conditioned inference | 省略模型仍可把厚度當直接量尺讀值~Presenting model-free thickness as a direct ruler reading
''')
lessons('a094', '''
缺陷單位~Defect units | 分開影像缺陷、實體缺陷與失效晶粒三種計數~Separate image detections, physical defects and failed dies | 多次檢出不一定代表多個實體缺陷~Multiple detections need not mean multiple physical defects | 把檢出事件數直接當失效晶粒數~Equating detection count with failed-die count
座標配準~Coordinate registration | 用晶圓缺口和三個不對稱標记對齊兩站地圖~Register two maps with a notch and asymmetric marks | 翻面及旋轉會改變座標對應~Flips and rotations change coordinate correspondence | 直接疊圖而不檢查鏡像~Overlaying maps without checking mirroring
檢出門檻~Detection threshold | 以假設真缺陷和背景分布繪製門檻取捨~Plot a hypothetical detection/background threshold tradeoff | 降低門檻可增加召回也增加誤警~Lower thresholds can increase recall and false alarms | 檢出越多就必然代表製程更差~Assuming more detections necessarily mean worse processing
人工真值~Reference labels | 建立雙人複核及爭議標籤，保留未知類別~Create dual review/disagreement labels and retain unknowns | 參考標籤本身也有不確定性~Reference labels themselves have uncertainty | 強迫所有模糊影像歸入已知類~Forcing every ambiguous image into known classes
混淆矩陣~Confusion matrix | 用假設刮傷、粒子與正常樣本算每類精確率召回率~Compute per-class precision/recall for scratches, particles and normal samples | 不平衡資料的總準確率可掩蓋少數失效~Overall accuracy can hide rare failures in imbalanced data | 只報全體準確率即证明關鍵缺陷可抓到~Using overall accuracy to prove critical-defect capture
尺寸與危害~Size and criticality | 將缺陷投到線距及接觸孔版圖，判讀短路與開路風險~Overlay defects on spacing/contact layouts and assess bridge/open risk | 缺陷危害取決於位置與圖形~Criticality depends on defect position and layout | 最大顆粒必然比所有小顆粒更致命~Assuming the largest particle is always most fatal
空間模式~Spatial patterns | 比較邊環、刮痕與隨機點的假設地圖~Compare hypothetical edge-ring, scratch and random maps | 空間模式可產生候選原因但非唯一因果~Spatial patterns suggest causes without proving uniqueness | 看到邊環就唯一指定某台設備~Assigning one tool uniquely from an edge ring
時間追溯~Temporal genealogy | 將缺陷發生片號連到設備、腔室與保養時刻~Link defect wafer IDs to tools, chambers and maintenance times | 共同暴露史比單一同時性更有辨識力~Shared exposure history is more informative than coincidence alone | 只看最後一台設備便確定來源~Blaming only the final tool
缺陷增量~Defect adders | 配對前後圖並保留消失、移動與新增三種情況~Pair pre/post maps and separate disappearing, moved and new detections | 新增數需要配準及檢出條件可比~Adders require registration and comparable detection conditions | 直接用兩站總數相減當新增實體數~Subtracting unaligned totals as physical adders
良率模型~Yield model | 用假設隨機獨立缺陷比較 Y=exp(-AD0) 與聚集情況~Compare hypothetical Poisson yield with clustered defects | Poisson 良率近似依賴獨立均勻假設~Poisson yield depends on independent uniform defects | 任意聚集分布都用同一密度精確預測~Predicting arbitrary clustering from mean density alone
電性關聯~Electrical correlation | 交叉列出視覺缺陷與電性失效，保留無對應案例~Cross-tab visual defects/electrical failures and retain unmatched cases | 不是每个可見缺陷都具電性影響~Not every visible defect has electrical impact | 影像分類即可取代電性驗證~Replacing electrical validation with image classification
改善驗證~Improvement verification | 用時間分割對照檢查修正前後缺陷和良率，固定檢出設定~Use time-separated controls with fixed detection settings | 檢查靈敏度改變可偽裝成製程改善~Inspection-sensitivity changes can mimic process improvement | 降低檢出靈敏度就當缺陷降低~Calling reduced sensitivity a defect reduction
''')
lessons('a095', '''
規格與控制~Specifications and control | 畫客戶規格線及由歷史資料估計的控制線~Draw customer specifications and history-estimated control limits | 控制線描述製程行為，規格線描述需求~Control limits describe behavior; specifications describe requirements | 把上下規格限直接當控制限~Using specification limits as control limits
合理分組~Rational subgroups | 對批次、腔室和時間排列假設量測，選擇組內與組間變異~Arrange data by lot/chamber/time and define within/between variation | 分組方式决定控制圖可看見的變動~Subgrouping determines which changes a chart can detect | 隨機混合不同腔室讓平均更穩定~Mixing chambers randomly to stabilize averages
量測系統~Measurement system | 比較重複量測與片間差異，估計儀器噪聲占比~Compare repeat measurements with wafer variation | 量測噪聲會影響製程變異估計~Measurement noise affects estimated process variation | 量測數字有小數點就忽略量具變異~Ignoring gauge variation because readings have decimals
基線期間~Baseline period | 標出已知維護、改版和异常，建立可追溯基線~Mark maintenance, changes and anomalies in a traceable baseline | 基線需要代表同一運作條件~A baseline must represent comparable operating conditions | 把所有歷史混在一起增加樣本數~Pooling incompatible history solely to increase sample size
Xbar 與 R~Xbar and range | 對假設小組計算平均与極差，分開位置及散布警報~Calculate subgroup means/ranges and separate location/spread alarms | 平均穩定不代表散布穩定~Stable means do not imply stable dispersion | 只看平均圖就核准製程穩定~Approving stability from the mean chart alone
個別值與移動極差~Individuals and moving range | 排列一次一筆的時間序列並計算相鄰差異~Order individual observations and compute successive differences | 時間順序是移動極差的必要條件~Time order is essential to moving ranges | 排序大小後再算移動極差~Sorting by value before calculating moving ranges
屬性資料~Attribute data | 比較每片缺陷數與不合格片比例，選擇合適分母~Separate defects per wafer from fraction defective with denominators | 缺陷數與不合格單位数不是同一分布~Defect counts and defective-unit counts differ | 一片多缺陷就算多片不合格~Counting several defects as several defective wafers
EWMA~Exponentially weighted averages | 用自訂 λ 計算小偏移的 EWMA，畫反應速度~Calculate EWMA for a small hypothetical shift with chosen lambda | 平滑權重控制記憶長度與反應~Smoothing weights control memory and response | λ 越小就能瞬間看出所有改變~Assuming smaller lambda instantly detects every change
自相關~Autocorrelation | 比較交替、緩慢漂移與獨立序列的相鄰相關~Compare alternating, drifting and independent sequences | 相關資料可能改變控制圖誤警率~Correlated data can alter chart false-alarm rates | 相同直方圖就代表相同時間行為~Equating identical histograms with identical temporal behavior
能力指標~Capability indices | 用假設平均與標準差算 Cp、Cpk，先驗證穩定與分布~Compute hypothetical Cp/Cpk after checking stability and distribution | 能力指標需要適用假設與穩定條件~Capability requires suitable assumptions and stability | 任意失控序列也可直接宣稱 Cpk 保證~Claiming capability guarantees for an unstable sequence
失控處置~Out-of-control action | 設計暫停、隔離、複測与原因調查的決策流程~Design hold, containment, remeasurement and investigation decisions | 警報是調查信號，不是自動证明產品報廢~An alarm triggers investigation, not automatic scrap proof | 所有超控制限產品立即判定無法使用~Declaring every control-limit exceedance unusable
變更管理~Change management | 保存控制限版本、重新基線理由及舊新並行比較~Preserve limit versions, rebaseline reasons and parallel comparison | 重設控制線不能取代原因改善~Resetting limits does not replace cause correction | 每次警報就放寬控制限~Widening limits after every alarm
''')
lessons('a096', '''
閉迴路邊界~Closed-loop boundary | 畫設定、製程、實測、估測及控制器的訊號方向~Draw setpoint, process, measurement, prediction and controller signal paths | 虛擬量測是推估，不是新增實體感測器~Virtual metrology is inference, not another physical sensor | 預測值存在就可宣稱已實際量到~Calling a prediction a physical measurement
Run-to-run 控制~Run-to-run control | 用假設線性增益將上一片誤差換成下一片小幅修正~Convert prior-wafer error to a bounded next-run correction | 控制更新有延遲且需要製程增益方向~Updates have delay and need the correct gain sign | 不知增益正負就直接反覆加大修正~Escalating corrections without knowing gain sign
資料時間戳~Data timestamps | 對齊設備訊號、晶圓 ID 与量測回傳時間~Align tool signals, wafer IDs and metrology return time | 訓練特徵必須在預測時已可取得~Training features must be available at prediction time | 把未來量測結果放入即時預測特徵~Using future measurements as real-time features
特徵萃取~Feature extraction | 由假設腔室曲線抽取穩態、斜率与積分，保留物理單位~Extract steady value, slope and integral from chamber traces with units | 統計特徵要有對應的製程語意~Statistical features need process meaning | 任意拼接所有數值不檢查單位~Concatenating every value without unit checks
時間切割~Temporal splitting | 用前期訓練、後期測試並把同批片放在同一側~Train on earlier data and test later with lot grouping | 隨機切片可能洩漏相同批次與漂移資訊~Random wafer splitting can leak lot/drift information | 同批高度相似片跨訓練測試宣稱泛化~Claiming generalization with near-identical lot samples on both sides
不確定度~Uncertainty estimates | 為每個預測附區間，檢查假設真值落入比例~Attach intervals and check hypothetical truth coverage | 預測區間需要校準而非只給數字~Prediction intervals need calibration | 模型說有信心就不需查真值覆蓋~Accepting model confidence without coverage checks
域外偵測~Out-of-domain detection | 將新配方、維護後及感測器異常和訓練範圍比較~Compare new recipes, post-maintenance and sensor faults with training coverage | 域外資料可能使小殘差歷史失效~Out-of-domain data can invalidate good historical residuals | 訓練誤差小就可套用所有新產品~Applying low-training-error models to every new product
抽樣策略~Sampling strategy | 按不確定度和風險分配假設實測預算，保留隨機查核~Allocate physical measurements by uncertainty/risk with random audits | 主動抽樣仍需避免永久忽略特定區域~Active sampling must avoid permanently neglecting regions | 永遠只測模型最有把握的樣本~Measuring only the most confident predictions
漂移監控~Drift monitoring | 分開輸入分布變動与預測殘差漂移~Separate input-distribution shift from residual drift | 輸入改變不一定等於輸出關係失效~Input shift does not necessarily mean the mapping failed | 只檢查平均輸入就證明模型穩定~Proving model stability from mean inputs alone
控制限幅~Control bounds | 為假設修正設定變化幅度限制及人工回復條件~Set hypothetical correction bounds and manual-recovery conditions | 高不確定度預測不應無限制驅動製程~Uncertain predictions should not drive unbounded changes | 模型輸出再極端也直接寫入設備~Sending arbitrarily extreme predictions directly to equipment
影子運行~Shadow operation | 同步計算建議但不下指令，與既有控制比較~Compute recommendations without actuation and compare existing control | 影子結果可評估預測但不能完整證明閉環穩定~Shadow results assess predictions, not full closed-loop stability | 離線準確就跳過所有閉迴路試驗~Skipping closed-loop trials after offline accuracy
版本回復~Version rollback | 保存特徵、模型、標準化與控制規則的共同版本~Version features, model, scaling and control policy together | 模型檔相同但前處理不同仍可能改變結果~Identical weights with changed preprocessing can change results | 只備份權重便可完整重現控制~Assuming weight backup alone reproduces control
''')
lessons('a097', '''
SMU 四象限~SMU quadrants | 畫源電壓量電流与源電流量電壓的模式~Draw voltage-source/current-measure and current-source/voltage-measure modes | 設定源量不等於被測端實際值~A source setting need not equal the actual DUT value | 只記設定值就當成實測電壓~Recording setpoints as measured voltage
接觸落針~Probe contact | 畫探針、焊墊與接觸污染，規劃接觸前後參考~Draw probe/pad contamination and pre/post contact checks | 接觸不良可模仿元件失效~Bad contact can mimic device failure | 第一次開路就直接報廢晶粒~Rejecting a die after one open contact
四線 Kelvin~Four-wire Kelvin | 分開 force 和 sense 線，指出感測輸入電流近似~Separate force/sense and state the low-sense-current assumption | Kelvin 可降低引線壓降但不能取消所有誤差~Kelvin reduces lead drop but not every error | 四線就不需要檢查任何接觸~Assuming four-wire measurement requires no contact checks
防漏與守衛~Leakage and guarding | 畫高阻量測表面漏電及守衛路徑~Draw leakage and guard paths in a high-resistance measurement | 守衛需跟隨合適電位，不只是接地~Guarding uses an appropriate potential, not simply ground | 把所有守衛都接地便一定最佳~Grounding every guard regardless of measurement
量測等待~Settling time | 對假設 RC 響應比較不同等待時間的誤差~Compare measurement error at different delays on a hypothetical RC response | 過快採樣可能量到暫態而非穩態~Sampling too soon can measure transients rather than steady state | 更快讀取不會影響 DC 準確度~Assuming faster reads cannot affect DC accuracy
電流限制~Compliance | 在假設 I-V 標出進入 compliance 的區段並區分設定和實際~Mark compliance regions and separate commanded/actual quantities | 限流期間施加條件可能偏離設定~Applied conditions can depart from setpoints during compliance | 被限流點仍當作固定設定電壓量測~Treating limited points as exact voltage-setpoint measurements
MOS 參數~MOS parameters | 用同一假設曲線比較固定電流及外推 Vth 定義~Compare constant-current and extrapolated thresholds on one curve | 不同 Vth 定義可產生不同數值~Different threshold definitions produce different values | 不同抽取法數字不等就一定量測錯~Calling every method difference an error
C-V 測試~C-V tests | 畫小訊號疊加 DC 偏壓並分開頻率与振幅~Draw small-signal AC on DC bias with frequency/amplitude | C-V 結果依頻率與寄生補償~C-V depends on frequency and parasitic correction | 不同頻率的電容可以無條件直接比較~Comparing capacitance at different frequencies without qualification
TLM 結構~TLM structures | 以假設距離系列回歸總電阻，檢查截距和非線性~Fit total resistance versus spacing and check intercept/nonlinearity | 接觸抽取依賴模型與一致幾何~Contact extraction depends on model and geometry consistency | 負截距直接當作真實負接觸電阻~Interpreting a negative intercept as physical negative contact resistance
晶圓測點~Wafer sites | 以坐標、晶粒、結構 ID 建立可追溯測試表~Build a traceable table of coordinates, die and structure IDs | 地圖分布需要正確測點身份~Spatial distributions require correct site identity | 測點順序可以取代永久結構 ID~Using run order instead of persistent structure IDs
測試順序~Test ordering | 比較先高應力再低漏電與相反順序的假設結果~Compare hypothetical high-stress-first and leakage-first sequences | 測試本身可能改變後續結果~Testing can alter subsequent results | 任何測試順序都必然互不影響~Assuming every test order is noninteracting
判限與重測~Limits and retest | 區分規格限、量測不確定度與接觸重測規則~Separate specification limits, uncertainty and contact-retest rules | 重測需事先規則避免挑選有利數據~Retest rules prevent selection of favorable results | 一直重測到通過就記最後一筆~Retesting until a pass and retaining only that result
''')
lessons('a098', '''
工廠與供應鏈~Fab and supply chain | 畫設計、晶圓製造、封裝与測試邊界，不填入未公開管線~Draw design, fab, packaging and test boundaries without inventing utility layouts | GIGAFAB 是製造組織與規模概念，不是一份公開設備配方~GIGAFAB describes manufacturing organization and scale, not a public equipment recipe | 用企業名稱推斷所有內部製程完全相同~Inferring identical internal flows from a company name
公用系統接口~Utility interfaces | 用功能方塊連接電力、水、氣、真空与設備需求~Connect power, water, gas and vacuum to tool needs using functional blocks | 每種公用系統有不同品質與連續性需求~Utilities have different purity and continuity requirements | 只比較總供應量就保證設備可運作~Guaranteeing tool operation from supply quantity alone
超純水回路~Ultrapure-water loop | 畫回流、監測和取用點，分開製程水与一般冷卻水~Draw return, monitoring and use points and distinguish process/cooling water | 入口合格不代表所有取用點條件一致~Inlet quality does not guarantee all point-of-use conditions | 只用市政水質標準代表晶圓接觸水~Using municipal-water criteria for wafer-contact water
潔淨氣流~Cleanroom airflow | 畫潔淨區与設備區的概念氣流，分开粒子与分子污染~Draw conceptual clean/tool-area airflow and distinguish particles from molecules | 粒子潔淨度不能取代分子污染控制~Particle cleanliness does not replace molecular-contamination control | 空氣看不見塵便證明所有污染受控~Treating invisible dust as proof all contamination is controlled
振動與基礎~Vibration and foundations | 列出設備、地板及鄰近機電的耦合路径，指定频率量測~List tool/floor/mechanical coupling paths with frequency measurements | 不同頻帶對不同設備有不同敏感度~Tools have frequency-dependent vibration sensitivities | 只用單一平均振幅核准所有機台~Approving all tools from one average amplitude
熱負載~Thermal loads | 建立設備、冷卻水與環境的假設能量平衡~Create a hypothetical tool/cooling/environment energy balance | 排熱能力與局部溫度穩定都是需求~Heat rejection and local temperature stability are both required | 冷凍噸足夠就必然沒有局部溫漂~Assuming sufficient cooling capacity eliminates local drift
冗餘與切換~Redundancy and switching | 畫雙路供應与共用節點，找出單點失效~Draw dual feeds and shared nodes and identify single points of failure | 重複設備可能仍共享失效來源~Duplicated equipment may share failure causes | 有兩台設備就必然完全容錯~Assuming two devices guarantee complete fault tolerance
自動搬運~Automated transport | 用假設載具队列追蹤機台等待、在製品與交接~Track hypothetical carrier queues, tool waits and WIP handoffs | 搬運效率需要和設備瓶頸一起分析~Transport efficiency must be analyzed with tool bottlenecks | 只加快運輸就必然縮短所有周期~Assuming faster transport shortens every cycle
集中管理~Centralized management | 畫跨廠製程版本、派工与品質資料的交換界面~Draw cross-fab recipe-version, dispatch and quality-data interfaces | 中央協作需保留各設備與批次追溯~Central coordination must preserve tool/lot traceability | 集中管理便可抹除所有設備差異~Assuming central management removes tool differences
設備節能~Equipment energy saving | 依假設排程比較工作、待機与喚醒能量，加入重新穩定時間~Compare active/idle/wakeup energy with restabilization time | 節能策略須同時驗證產能和製程穩定~Energy strategies need throughput and process-stability checks | 關機时间越長就一定總成本最低~Assuming longer shutdown always minimizes total cost
水循環盤查~Water accounting | 分開取水、回收、再使用与排放，檢查假設質量平衡~Separate withdrawal, recovery, reuse and discharge in a mass balance | 回收率須清楚定義分母和邊界~Recovery rates require defined denominators and boundaries | 把循環流量重複算成新增節水量~Counting circulating flow repeatedly as new savings
公開案例審查~Public-case review | 將官方事實、教學假設和未公開部分三欄列明~Separate official facts, teaching assumptions and undisclosed details | 公開績效不能反推出專有控制配方~Public performance does not reveal proprietary control recipes | 以公開節能百分比還原內部所有設定~Reconstructing all settings from a public savings percentage
''')
lessons('a099', '''
試驗線目的~Pilot-line purpose | 畫研究假說、試片、學習迴圈与量產移轉四個功能~Draw hypothesis, test vehicle, learning cycle and production-transfer functions | 試驗線用於技術驗證，與量產工廠目標不同~Pilot lines validate technology and differ from volume-fab objectives | 有最先進設備便等於產品已量產~Equating advanced equipment with production-ready products
跨國節點~Distributed nodes | 依官方資料畫 imec 與合作研究機構，不臆測每台設備所在地~Map imec and official research partners without guessing tool locations | 分散合作需要清楚接口及資料責任~Distributed collaboration needs clear interfaces and data responsibility | 所有合作工作都假設在同一無塵室~Assuming all partner work happens in one cleanroom
技術模組~Technology modules | 分開邏輯、記憶體、光電互連及封裝的輸入輸出~Separate logic, memory, optical/electrical links and packaging interfaces | 超越節點縮放還包括異質整合~Beyond-node development also involves heterogeneous integration | 小節點名稱已完整描述全部系統能力~Treating a node label as a complete system capability description
探索 PDK~Pathfinding PDK | 列出設計探索模型、設計規則与已知不確定性~List pathfinding models, rules and known uncertainties | 探索模型不等於量產保證模型~Pathfinding models are not production-guaranteed models | 探索 PDK 通過便保證可立即流片量產~Assuming a pathfinding pass guarantees immediate volume fabrication
系統探索~System exploration | 畫既有晶圓與新增模組的相容接口~Draw compatibility interfaces between existing wafers and new modules | 系統探索需考慮既有層的熱及電性邊界~System exploration must respect existing-layer thermal/electrical limits | 新模組可任意改變已完成晶圓而不影響其餘功能~Changing finished wafers without affecting existing functions
High-NA 接入~High-NA integration | 畫曝光、光阻、蝕刻与量測的閉環學習鏈~Draw the lithography/resist/etch/metrology learning loop | 新曝光機必須與其他製程模組共同驗證~New scanners need validation with other process modules | 設備到貨就等於所有圖形已可穩定製造~Equating tool arrival with stable pattern manufacture
測試載具~Test vehicles | 為接觸、互連与記憶各設計一個隔離風險的假設試片~Design hypothetical contact, link and memory vehicles isolating risks | 試片應將技術風險轉為可量測問題~Test vehicles turn technology risks into measurements | 只做完整大晶片才算有效研究~Treating only full large chips as useful research
分批實驗~Split experiments | 建立只改兩項變因的假設分批矩陣，保留對照~Build a two-factor hypothetical split with controls | 實驗矩陣有助區分交互作用~Experimental matrices help separate interactions | 同時更改全部模組後仍能單獨歸因~Attributing causes after changing every module
量測互通~Metrology interoperability | 將跨機構尺寸定義、校正和不確定度放入交換表~Align cross-institution definitions, calibration and uncertainties | 相同欄名不保證相同量測定義~Identical column names do not ensure identical measurands | 同寫 CD 就可直接合併所有數據~Pooling every CD value solely from its label
資料與存取~Data and access | 用假設合作案分開公開結果、受限資料与可分享模型~Separate public results, restricted data and shareable models in a hypothetical project | 技術存取和公開再散布是不同授權~Technology access and public redistribution are different permissions | 參與試驗線便代表可以公開所有圖檔~Assuming participation permits publication of all files
成熟度門檻~Maturity gates | 定義可重複性、晶圓分布、可靠度与移轉文件的驗收~Define repeatability, wafer distributions, reliability and transfer evidence | 成熟度是證據集合，不只是單一最佳指標~Maturity is a body of evidence, not a record metric | 單顆最佳展示就視為可量產成熟~Treating one record device as manufacturing maturity
里程碑核對~Milestone verification | 分開無塵室啟用、設備到貨、安裝校正与試片產出~Separate cleanroom opening, arrival, qualification and test output | 各里程碑代表不同完成程度~Milestones represent different completion states | 把預定時程當成已完成量測結果~Treating a schedule as completed measurement evidence
''')
