extra('a097','SMU 的量程切換可能產生暫態~SMU range switching can create transients | 接觸重測應保留首次紀錄~Contact retesting should preserve first results | Sense 接觸開路仍會破壞量測~An open sense contact still breaks measurement | 護衛放大器也有穩定度限制~Guard amplifiers also have stability limits | 積分時間可抑制電源頻率干擾~Integration time can suppress mains interference | 儀器輸出電容可造成瞬態超調~Output capacitance can create transient overshoot | 遷移率抽取也依有效幾何~Mobility extraction needs effective geometry | Open/short 補償需同一夾具配置~Open/short correction needs the same fixture | 有效線寬誤差會改變片電阻~Width errors bias sheet resistance | 邊緣排除區需明確標示~Edge exclusions need explicit marking | 熱穩定時間與電性等待時間不同~Thermal settling differs from electrical settling | 判限守門需考慮假接受和假拒絕~Guardbanding balances false acceptance/rejection')
extra('a098','廠區公開位置不等於內部設備座標~Public fab locations do not expose tool positions | 供應品質變動可造成共同失效~Utility-quality shifts can create common failures | 回流監測也需考慮管路停滯~Return monitoring must consider stagnation | 分子污染可能來自材料逸氣~Outgassing can cause molecular contamination | 共振可能放大特定頻率擾動~Resonance amplifies specific frequencies | 換熱器接近溫差限制效率~Approach temperatures constrain heat exchange | 共用控制器也可能是單點失效~Shared controllers can be single failure points | 派工規則會改變機台閒置時間~Dispatch policy changes tool idle time | 版本一致不代表機台硬體狀態一致~Version agreement does not guarantee hardware equivalence | 喚醒後需驗證可用而非只顯示通電~Wakeup needs readiness, not merely power-on status | 水質不同不能直接互換用途~Different water qualities are not interchangeable | 廣告目標與已量測成果應分開~Separate announced targets from measured achievements')
extra('a099','技術成功也需評估可移轉性~Technical success also needs transferability assessment | 共通文件格式仍需語意一致~Common file formats still need semantic consistency | 系統瓶頸不一定是最小電晶體~System bottlenecks are not necessarily smallest transistors | PDK 版本改動可改變設計結論~PDK versions can change design conclusions | 新模組的良率會乘入整體良率~New-module yield compounds system yield | 圖形轉移損傷也需獨立驗證~Pattern-transfer damage needs independent validation | 對照試片應保留相同量測條件~Controls need matching measurement conditions | 分批設計須記錄交互作用假設~Split designs need stated interaction assumptions | 跨站時間戳也需共同定義~Cross-site timestamps require common definitions | 分享模型也須說明使用邊界~Shared models need use-boundary documentation | 樣本數與失敗樣本不能從門檻中消失~Gates must retain sample counts and failures | 設備校正和產品資格是不同驗收~Tool qualification and product qualification differ')
