 c=dict(id=cid,title=base['title'],titleEn=base['titleEn'],category='semiconductor',kind=base.get('kind','craft'),status='guided',contentStatus='reviewable-educational-curriculum',curriculumVersion=8,depth=4,stepCount=24,estimatedMinutes=540,languageCoverage=['zh-TW','en'],sourceIds=[SOURCES[k]['id'] for k in keys],simulationOnly=True,summary='從'+rows[0][0][0]+'、'+rows[4][0][0]+'到'+rows[-1][0][0]+'：以 12 項工程決策、24 個模型與診斷工作包建立證據。',summaryEn='From '+rows[0][0][1]+' and '+rows[4][0][1]+' to '+rows[-1][0][1]+': build evidence through twelve engineering decisions and twenty-four modeling/diagnostic work packages.',scope='公開原理的教學拆解：12 個技術主題各有模型／分析及故障／驗證兩步，共四階段 24 步。不是 24 道實際製造配方，也不是任何廠商量產流程。數值由學員自訂並標示為假設；涉及材料加工、高壓、雷射或化學品的活動僅做圖上與資料分析，不由網頁授權實機操作。',scopeEn='A public-principles educational decomposition: twelve technical topics each have a model/analysis step and a diagnosis/verification step, organized as four stages and twenty-four work packages. These are not twenty-four fabrication recipes or a manufacturer flow. Learner-selected numbers are hypothetical; materials processing, high voltage, lasers and chemicals are studied through diagrams/data, not authorized physical operation.',diagram=dict(type='wafer',labels=[r[0][0] for r in rows[::3]],labelsEn=[r[0][1] for r in rows[::3]],original=True,notToScale=True),stages=stages)
